011-01-23", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 98557, "name": "Mockingbird Lane", "adult": false, "overview": "Settling into their new home—the rambling Victorian mansion at 1313 Mockingbird Lane— the Munster are quickly onto the mission at hand: to gently ease sweet little Eddie into the reality of his werewolf adolescence. The loving, supportive, run-of-the-mill family includes his mom Lily, the daughter of Dracula, his dad Herman, who brings new meaning to \\"Frankenstein,\\" and Grandpa! Of course, there's creepy cousin Marilyn, who's really the odd one because she's so completely normal.", "genre_ids": [10765, 18, 35], "popularity": 1.2989, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/sAMzLVXENFzfGEnIvX9U4jjHclZ.jpg", "vote_average": 7, "backdrop_path": "/6onqjBWEAq5PzyLS1ZuAg5b9aJc.jpg", "original_name": "Mockingbird Lane", "first_air_date": "2012-10-26", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 98584, "name": "Shachibato! President, It's Time for Battle!", "adult": false, "overview": "Based on the popular strategy game, Minato has become the new president of the Kibou Company. In order to be a good president and help the company grow, he must lead his party of adventurers through the Gate and collect Kirakuri — a type of energy that is extremely valuable and fundamental to the city of Gatepia. However, there are other companies vying for the chance to gather the Kirakuri.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 10765], "popularity": 1.4792, "vote_count": 17, "poster_path": "/yPct2dcnBvGuS1prYtNyiI1TTgj.jpg", "vote_average": 7.059, "backdrop_path": "/o0AeKGvb5hcRaza1NewITmlwGpQ.jpg", "original_name": "社長、バトルの時間です!", "first_air_date": "2020-04-05", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 98685, "name": "Monster Girl Doctor", "adult": false, "overview": "In the town of Lindworm where monsters and humans coexist, Dr. Glenn runs an exemplary medical clinic for monster girls with his lamia assistant, Sapphee. Whether recei