s a similar style to the original anthology series. Each episode tells a tale (sometimes two or three) rooted in horror or suspense, often with a surprising twist at the end. Episodes usually feature elements of drama and comedy.", "genre_ids": [10765, 18, 9648], "popularity": 16.2128, "vote_count": 237, "poster_path": "/5OYHoUEKE3RJMqiHcJ8XA5kB7bw.jpg", "vote_average": 7.7, "backdrop_path": "/fy9fhl09shpTLjw4IEqqmVMYM28.jpg", "original_name": "The Twilight Zone", "first_air_date": "1985-09-27", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 47640, "name": "The Strain", "adult": false, "overview": "A high concept thriller that tells the story of Dr. Ephraim Goodweather, the head of the Center for Disease Control Canary Team in New York City. He and his team are called upon to investigate a mysterious viral outbreak with hallmarks of an ancient and evil strain of vampirism. As the strain spreads, Eph, his team, and an assembly of everyday New Yorkers, wage war for the fate of humanity itself.", "genre_ids": [10765, 18, 9648], "popularity": 19.1242, "vote_count": 1915, "poster_path": "/2BWErT9QcADpf2G4BZ769eSnFTP.jpg", "vote_average": 7.476, "backdrop_path": "/4YnAZ1KO9goeS4c06VO7HXiO3oO.jpg", "original_name": "The Strain", "first_air_date": "2014-07-13", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 1087, "name": "Serial Experiments Lain", "adult": false, "overview": "Lain—driven by the abrupt suicide of a classmate—logs on to the Wired and promptly loses herself in a twisted mass of hallucinations, memories, and interconnected-psyches.", "genre_ids": [16, 18, 10765, 9648], "popularity": 6.5352, "vote_count": 581, "poster_path": "/2eAPjPjkkiF10vOiHjECRIDXqtd.jpg", "vote_average": 8.224, "backdrop_path": "/nFSFdAn8freV16fmSC9rKggXzDl.jpg", "original_name": "serial experiments lain", "first_air_date": "1998-07-06", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 1097, "name": "Ergo Proxy", "adult": false, "overview": "In a futuristic world almost barren of life, mankind is confined to mechanized domed cities where A.I.’s control all aspects of life. In this world, humans are no longer born, they are manufactured in a production line; and alongside them live androids known as autoreivs. Within one of these domed sanctuaries named Romdeau lives Re-l Mayer, one of a few citizens who aren’t entirely prevented from thinking. Her grandfather's prominent position and the affection of the scientist Daedalus have left her more free will than is normally allowed, but Re-l has started to question the sanctity of the city and the citizens' perfect way of life. With mysterious beings known as proxies causing havoc and a man named Vincent causing great influence on her life, Re-l must travel outside of the city to find the answers she seeks and discover the mystery behind \\"the awakening\\".", "genre_ids": [16, 10765, 9648], "popularity": 11.6729, "vote_count": 365, "poster_path": "/tHcce6PKnhNBneSMbadI4jynHpY.jpg", "vote_average": 7.6, "backdrop_path": "/jGAgj9QztYjSsYCnZhDMgBUzQKU.jpg", "original_name": "Ergo Proxy", "first_air_date": "2006-02-25", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 1622, "name": "Supernatural", "adult": false, "overview": "When they were boys, Sam and Dean Winchester lost their mother to a mysterious and demonic supernatural force. Subsequently, their father raised them to be soldiers. He taught them about the paranormal evil that lives in the dark corners and on the back roads of America ... and he taught them how to kill it. Now, the Winchester brothers crisscross the country in their '67 Chevy Impala, battling every kind of supernatural threat they encounter along the way. ", "genre_ids": [18, 9648, 10765], "popularity": 109.348, "vote_count": 8021, "poster_path": "/KoYWXbnYuS3b0GyQPkbuexlVK9.jpg", "vote_average": 8.301, "backdrop_path": "/lirPqYLTtd6XZqGn4cS1wiesTq0.jpg", "original_name": "Supernatural", "first_air_date": "2005-09-13", "origin_country"