h school who dreams of becoming a pop singer. At school she gets a new roommate, Irene (Sun Woong) who’s actually a boy. Irene’s persona is a pretty Female CF star and his actual name is Hyun Woo.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 0.8095, "vote_count": 13, "poster_path": "/j3TNH3r1VjNr7rGxEip2InBUVGP.jpg", "vote_average": 3.3, "backdrop_path": "/w1Dtmdy4N0Nt1fnKi5wukIow0YT.jpg", "original_name": "마보이", "first_air_date": "2012-08-16", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 178, "name": "My Life as a Teenage Robot", "adult": false, "overview": "Jenny, aka XJ-9, is a super-powered robot with a super-sensitive teenage heart. Her primary function is protecting the planet from disaster, but – like all teenagers – she has her own ideas about how she would like to live her life. Bored with being a superhero, Jenny wants to do something really exciting – like go to high school!", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10759, 10765, 10762], "popularity": 6.5749, "vote_count": 178, "poster_path": "/xHucEYE9gZDCqQA1tZeCJe9x0JN.jpg", "vote_average": 7.413, "backdrop_path": "/cCy8zz9QcI3bzzfMtbvixk7hYmq.jpg", "original_name": "My Life as a Teenage Robot", "first_air_date": "2002-10-18", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 185, "name": "Carnivàle", "adult": false, "overview": "Carnivàle is an American television series set in the United States during the Great Depression and Dust Bowl. In tracing the lives of two disparate groups of people, its overarching story depicts the battle between good and evil and the struggle between free will and destiny; the storyline mixes Christian theology with gnosticism and Masonic lore, particularly that of the Knights Templar.", "genre_ids": [10765, 9648, 18], "popularity": 5.4349, "vote_count": 435, "poster_path": "/5pKvfZ3qLuKJd8PQfKcPxN9jTO9.jpg", "vote_average": 7.917, "backdrop_path": "/gPXlZQr7PR3Ay2pP6XBdvVKmM25.jpg", "original_name": "Carnivàle", "first_air_date": "2003-09-14", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 246, "name": "Avatar: The Last Airbender", "adult": false, "overview": "In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 10765], "popularity": 12.8519, "vote_count": 4500, "poster_path": "/yaGt4GIutpbXHsv48tWceWg6s56.jpg", "vote_average": 8.759, "backdrop_path": "/kU98MbVVgi72wzceyrEbClZmMFe.jpg", "original_name": "Avatar: The Last Airbender", "first_air_date": "2005-02-21", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 255, "name": "Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi", "adult": false, "overview": "Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi follows the adventures of two very cool, but very different pop stars as they travel from gig to gig or just hang out in their tour bus. Being famous rock stars, Ami and Yumi tour the globe in their customized Puffy bus, a veritable condo on wheels with all the major amenities and an ever-changing interior. Ami is the peppy, positive, and resourceful one. Yumi is the hard-rocking, no-nonsense cynic with an absolutely infallible sense of cool. Together, these superstars take the world by storm with musical talent, trend-setting style and humor, despite occasional misjudgments from their well-meaning but tragically square manager, Kaz.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10762], "popularity": 7.3793, "vote_count": 139, "poster_path": "/dVlsQzfxewEdHpu7SiVUpRAVNyU.jpg", "vote_average": 7.295, "backdrop_path": "/16JZ5IRrA9YSxVSqWflY0nLhLwz.jpg", "original_name": "Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi", "first_air_date": "2004-11-19", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 318, "name": "American Gothic", "adult": false, "overview": "Everything is not what it seems in Trinity, South Carolina. Sheriff Lucas Buck develops a sinister interest in Caleb. Caleb's cousin Gail tries to protect him, but that's complicated since she has feelings for Sheriff Buck. And Caleb's dead sister, Merlyn, retur