tle": "Trainspotting", "video": false, "overview": "Heroin addict Mark Renton stumbles through bad ideas and sobriety attempts with his unreliable friends --Sick Boy, Begbie, Spud and Tommy. He also has an underage girlfriend, Diane, along for the ride. After cleaning up and moving from Edinburgh to London, Mark finds he can't escape the life he left behind as Begbie and Sick Boy come knocking.", "genre_ids": [18, 80], "popularity": 6.4857, "vote_count": 10047, "poster_path": "/1jUC02qsqS2NxBMFarbIhcQtazV.jpg", "release_date": "1996-02-23", "vote_average": 7.96, "backdrop_path": "/wUc83y8kXNdRK66o0HU5X8eBri4.jpg", "original_title": "Trainspotting", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 628, "adult": false, "title": "Interview with the Vampire", "video": false, "overview": "A vampire relates his epic life story of love, betrayal, loneliness, and dark hunger to an over-curious reporter.", "genre_ids": [27, 18, 14], "popularity": 6.9878, "vote_count": 6132, "poster_path": "/2162lAT2MP36MyJd2sttmj5du5T.jpg", "release_date": "1994-11-11", "vote_average": 7.382, "backdrop_path": "/3fChciF2G1wXHsyTfJD9y7uN6Il.jpg", "original_title": "Interview with the Vampire", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 631, "adult": false, "title": "Sunrise: A Song of Two Humans", "video": false, "overview": "A married farmer falls under the spell of a slatternly woman from the city, who tries to convince him to drown his wife.", "genre_ids": [18, 10749], "popularity": 3.7717, "vote_count": 854, "poster_path": "/oj8ZW8jKXBSs8F1e5iWsTUeXSJW.jpg", "release_date": "1927-11-04", "vote_average": 7.83, "backdrop_path": "/hKrrCigPFmhv1bg5IJl9nzjEaN4.jpg", "original_title": "Sunrise: A Song of Two Humans", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 633, "adult": false, "title": "Soldier of Orange", "video": false, "overview": "The lives of Erik Lanshof and five of his closest friends take different paths when the German army invades the Netherlands in 1940: fight and resistance, fear and resignation, collaboration