"original_name": "Jérémy Lagniez", "known_for_department": "Crew"}]}, "imdb_id": "tt17526714", "revenue": 76506196, "runtime": 141, "similar": {"page": 1, "results": [{"id": 1273287, "adult": false, "title": "Die Mutigen 56 - Deutschlands längster Streik", "video": false, "overview": "Emma Freese is desperate when her husband Alfred falls ill at the Howaldtswerke in Kiel. How is the family supposed to get by without their wages? The war has scarred this generation, but now things are supposed to be looking up. The workers want their fair share and are fighting for an income that also gives them room to live. In October 1956, 34,000 metalworkers in the shipyards and factories of Schleswig-Holstein walk off the job to fight for justice and their dignity. This strike is still regarded as the toughest and longest in Germany. Employers and politicians stand in the strikers' way.", "genre_ids": [99, 18, 36], "popularity": 1.5126, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": null, "release_date": "2024-04-28", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": "/m8pMadCHwHjJ2Q9jGhHVOMB1gYA.jpg", "original_title": "Die Mutigen 56 - Deutschlands längster Streik", "original_language": "de"}, {"id": 570, "adult": false, "title": "Fat Girl", "video": false, "overview": "Anaïs is twelve and bears the weight of the world on her shoulders. She watches her older sister, Elena, whom she both loves and hates. Elena is fifteen and devilishly beautiful. Neither more futile, nor more stupid than her younger sister, she cannot understand that she is merely an object of desire. And, as such, she can only be taken. Or had. Indeed, this is the subject: a girl's loss of virginity. And, that summer, it opens a door to tragedy.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 3.4853, "vote_count": 238, "poster_path": "/afzbY1h7huuxlITigPfcyQSkqLs.jpg", "release_date": "2001-03-07", "vote_average": 6.2, "backdrop_path": "/pnwI95K4pmYeM3LsMRTQYzvhvvO.jpg", "original_title": "À ma sœur !", "original_language": "fr"}, {"id": 596, "adult": false, "title": "The Grapes of Wrath", "video": false, "overview": "Tom Joad returns to his home after a jail sentence to find his family kicked out of their farm due to foreclosure. He catches up with them on his Uncle’s farm, and joins them the next day as they head for California and a new life... Hopefully.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 4.4528, "vote_count": 1048, "poster_path": "/eUcxMVBIA0Jg8l1RGUqycrc3eIQ.jpg", "release_date": "1940-03-15", "vote_average": 7.814, "backdrop_path": "/eMgflonfRY89Zj4LZykJKPpG4wg.jpg", "original_title": "The Grapes of Wrath", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 599, "adult": false, "title": "Sunset Boulevard", "video": false, "overview": "A hack screenwriter writes a screenplay for a former silent film star who has faded into Hollywood obscurity.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 6.1672, "vote_count": 2768, "poster_path": "/oOZIN0sbRNLKQC4RRCQnmAx1PlV.jpg", "release_date": "1950-08-10", "vote_average": 8.291, "backdrop_path": "/p47ihFj4A7EpBjmPHdTj4ipyq1S.jpg", "original_title": "Sunset Boulevard", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 604, "adult": false, "title": "The Matrix Reloaded", "video": false, "overview": "The Resistance builds in numbers as humans are freed from the Matrix and brought to the city of Zion. Neo discovers his superpowers, including the ability to see the code inside the Matrix. With machine sentinels digging to Zion in 72 hours, Neo, Morpheus and Trinity must find the Keymaker to ultimately reach the Source.", "genre_ids": [12, 28, 53, 878], "popularity": 8.4393, "vote_count": 11489, "poster_path": "/9TGHDvWrqKBzwDxDodHYXEmOE6J.jpg", "release_date": "2003-05-15", "vote_average": 7.1, "backdrop_path": "/u2IlqBzlGqMwDnQsoskjCohgaPO.jpg", "original_title": "The Matrix Reloaded", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 614, "adult": false, "title": "Wild Strawberries", "video": false, "overview": "Crotchety retired doctor Isak Borg travels from Stockholm to Lund, Sweden, with his pregnant and unhappy daughter-in-law, Marianne, in order to receive an honorary degree from his alma mater. Along the way, they encounter a series of hitchhikers, each of whom causes the elderly doctor to muse upon the pleasures and failures of his own life. These include the vivacious young Sara, a dead ringer for the doctor's own first love.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 4.3545, "vote_count": 1731, "poster_path": "/iyTD2QnySNMPUPE3IedZQipSWfz.jpg", "release_date": "1957-08-28", "vote_average": 8.1, "backdrop_path": "/BBVAUchYvkmPThVIqipgAfabfl.jpg", "original_title": "Smultronstället", "original_language": "sv"}, {"id": 619, "adult": false, "title": "The Bodyguard", "video": false, "overview": "A former Secret Service agent grudgingly takes an assignment to protect a pop idol who's threatened by a crazed fan. At first, the safety-obsessed bodyguard and the self-indulgent diva totally clash. But before long, all that tension sparks fireworks of another sort, and the love-averse tough guy is torn between duty and romance.", "genre_ids": [28, 18, 10749], "popularity": 4.249, "vote_count": 3098, "poster_path": "/ihWF0uY1xnKqw9YK7ZHNLUZOhcO.jpg", "release_date": "1992-11-25", "vote_average": 6.7, "backdrop_path": "/bJyb7Bk9PLUslPggangniTBLzHO.jpg", "original_title": "The Bodyguard", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 629, "adult": false, "title": "The Usual Suspects", "video": false, "overview": "Held in an L.A. interrogation room, Verbal Kint attempts to convince the feds that a mythic crime lord, Keyser Soze, not only exists, but was also responsible for drawing him and his four partners into a multi-million dollar heist that ended with an explosion in San Pedro harbor – leaving few survivors. Verbal lures his interrogators with an incredible story of the crime lord's almost supernatural prowess.", "genre_ids": [18, 80, 53], "popularity": 7.8468, "vote_count": 10908, "poster_path": "/99X2SgyFunJFXGAYnDv3sb9pnUD.jpg", "release_date": "1995-07-19", "vote_average": 8.171, "backdrop_path": "/9jrH