s", "video": false, "overview": "When the seaside community of Amity finds itself under attack by a dangerous great white shark, the town's chief of police, a young marine biologist, and a grizzled hunter embark on a desperate quest to destroy the beast before it strikes again.", "genre_ids": [27, 53, 12], "popularity": 11.545, "vote_count": 11062, "poster_path": "/lxM6kqilAdpdhqUl2biYp5frUxE.jpg", "release_date": "1975-06-20", "vote_average": 7.679, "backdrop_path": "/bW6GHF3Yg9fSsJGlRVHXlGY8vaM.jpg", "original_title": "Jaws", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 581, "adult": false, "title": "Dances with Wolves", "video": false, "overview": "Wounded Civil War soldier John Dunbar tries to commit suicide—and becomes a hero instead. As a reward, he's assigned to his dream post, a remote junction on the Western frontier, and soon makes unlikely friends with the local Sioux tribe.", "genre_ids": [12, 18, 37], "popularity": 6.1674, "vote_count": 4486, "poster_path": "/hw0ZEHAaTqTxSXGVwUFX7uvanSA.jpg", "release_date": "1990-03-30", "vote_average": 7.8, "backdrop_path": "/ywWva4trKw7f3wtbz81Fe3FnrtC.jpg", "original_title": "Dances with Wolves", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 587, "adult": false, "title": "Big Fish", "video": false, "overview": "Throughout his life Edward Bloom has always been a man of big appetites, enormous passions and tall tales. In his later years, he remains a huge mystery to his son, William. Now, to get to know the real man, Will begins piecing together a true picture of his father from flashbacks of his amazing adventures.", "genre_ids": [12, 14, 18], "popularity": 5.6765, "vote_count": 7487, "poster_path": "/tjK063yCgaBAluVU72rZ6PKPH2l.jpg", "release_date": "2003-12-25", "vote_average": 7.755, "backdrop_path": "/bLqUd0tBvKezDr9MEla7k34i3rp.jpg", "original_title": "Big Fish", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 601, "adult": false, "title": "E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial", "video": false, "overview": "An alien is left behind on Earth and saved by the 10-year-old Elliott who decides to keep him hidden in his home. While a task force hunts for the extra-terrestrial, Elliott, his brother, and his little sister Gertie form an emotional bond with their new friend, and try to help him find his way home.", "genre_ids": [878, 12, 10751, 14], "popularity": 12.4119, "vote_count": 11592, "poster_path": "/an0nD6uq6byfxXCfk6lQBzdL2J1.jpg", "release_date": "1982-06-11", "vote_average": 7.513, "backdrop_path": "/mXLVA0YL6tcXi6SJSuAh9ONXFj5.jpg", "original_title": "E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 620, "adult": false, "title": "Ghostbusters", "video": false, "overview": "After losing their academic posts at a prestigious university, a team of parapsychologists goes into business as proton-pack-toting \\"ghostbusters\\" who exterminate ghouls, hobgoblins and supernatural pests of all stripes. An ad campaign pays off when a knockout cellist hires the squad to purge her swanky digs of demons that appear to be living in her refrigerator.", "genre_ids": [35, 14], "popularity": 9.8088, "vote_count": 9380, "poster_path": "/7E8nLijS9AwwUEPu2oFYOVKhdFA.jpg", "release_date": "1984-06-08", "vote_average": 7.495, "backdrop_path": "/c6yfABGVKuB5cjoOwdX4AJMlzUz.jpg", "original_title": "Ghostbusters", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 628, "adult": false, "title": "Interview with the Vampire", "video": false, "overview": "A vampire relates his epic life story of love, betrayal, loneliness, and dark hunger to an over-curious reporter.", "genre_ids": [27, 18, 14], "popularity": 6.9878, "vote_count": 6132, "poster_path": "/2162lAT2MP36MyJd2sttmj5du5T.jpg", "release_date": "1994-11-11", "vote_average": 7.382, "backdrop_path": "/3fChciF2G1wXHsyTfJD9y7uN6Il.jpg", "original_title": "Interview with the Vampire", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 371645, "adult": false, "title": "Hunt for the Wilderpeople", "video": false, "overview": "Ricky is a defiant young city kid who finds himself on the run with his cantankero