Q7.jpg", "vote_average": 7.2, "episode_count": 6, "season_number": 3}], "similar": {"page": 1, "results": [{"id": 46290, "name": "×××HOLiC", "adult": false, "overview": "Yūko Ichihara is the sexy owner of a strange store which offers to make any wishes come true for a price. Kimihiro Watanuki has a special type of blood that attracts spirits and ghosts. He goes into the shop owned by Yūko Ichihara and asks her to get rid of the spirits. Yūko offers to do so if he works part-time at the store.", "genre_ids": [18, 9648], "popularity": 1.4899, "vote_count": 14, "poster_path": "/oO5H6jHNyIYAiPRaG5WgdyfeDjX.jpg", "vote_average": 7.4, "backdrop_path": "/lznvi1kIdWeXCBCiEeNSKUL8pLk.jpg", "original_name": "CLAMPドラマ　ホリック　×××HOLiC", "first_air_date": "2013-02-23", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46314, "name": "Zombie-Loan", "adult": false, "overview": "Based on the manga by PEACH-PIT, serialised in G-Fantasy. When a human is marked to die, a faint gray line that is invisible to most appears around their neck. As time passes, that ring becomes darker and darker, until it is eventually black, and that person dies. Kita Michiru has an unusual gift - she posses \\"Shinigami eyes,\\" which allow her to see these rings. When Michiru notices that two of the boys in her Class, Akatsuki Chika and Tachibana Shito not only have rings, but that they`re jet black, they reveal to her that the were supposed to die in a tragic accident six months ago. With the help of the Zombie Loan loan office, they were given a second chance at life, should they be able to pay for their debt by doing the work of Shinigami and killing malicious zombies. They petition Michiru to assist them in their efforts, and she finds her everyday life changing dramatically.", "genre_ids": [16, 10765, 35, 18, 9648], "popularity": 2.262, "vote_count": 8, "poster_path": "/9A8cVFEYvO1OwrGjezunFMc5o66.jpg", "vote_average": 5.7, "backdrop_path": "/sMfNR2TXb0ECIh7y6IDLorPOfND.jpg", "original_name": "ゾンビローン", "first_air_date": "2007-07-03", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46342, "name": "Okamikakushi: Masque of the Wolf", "adult": false, "overview": "Kuzumi Hiroshi moves with his crippled sister and his father to  the remote city of Jouga, which is famous for its hassaku citrus and the  rumors that a species of enormous wolves once lived in the area. While  some of the residents are more than friendly, when people begin to  vanish suddenly, it becomes apparent that something sinister is afoot...", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 9648], "popularity": 1.805, "vote_count": 9, "poster_path": "/bH6m58wqVYpeDkar8zp2pw4RN8o.jpg", "vote_average": 8.7, "backdrop_path": "/nqmWVA0rP7zTrGQtCZKLqbJVXxy.jpg", "original_name": "おおかみかくし", "first_air_date": "2010-01-07", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46345, "name": "Tokyo Mew Mew", "adult": false, "overview": "On her first date with the cutest boy in school, Ichigo is zapped by a  mysterious ray that scrambles her DNA with that of the endangered Iriomote wildcat. The next day, Ichigo discovers that she has developed the agility (and occasionally the ears and tail) of a cat, as well as the power to transform into a pink-haired superheroine, Mew Ichigo. She and four other girls, each endowed with the genes of a different \\"Red Data\\" animal, have been selected for the top-secret Mew Project, which aims to protect the Earth from an alien menace known as Deep Blue.", "genre_ids": [16, 10762, 10765, 10759, 35, 10751], "popularity": 5.0669, "vote_count": 107, "poster_path": "/vEBuze5ULPfMYfMX8BYuVa2moRs.jpg", "vote_average": 7.6, "backdrop_path": "/ijLRv7VZzLhYiEt7UiBQowlVscr.jpg", "original_name": "東京ミュウミュウ", "first_air_date": "2002-04-06", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46388, "name": "PERSONA 4 the Animation", "adult": false, "overview": "When Yu Narukami moves to the rural country town of Inaba to live with his uncle while his parents are away on business, he's expecting a lot more peace and quiet than he's been used to in the big city. Instead, the peace has been shattered as a rash of mysterious murders and kidnappings sweep the countryside. With the police stymied, Yu finds himself joining with a group of seven other teenagers in a desperate bid to solve the mystery. A mystery that is somehow connected to both the local weather patterns and a strange TV world which Yu, his friends and the enigmatic killer can all enter.", "genre_ids": [16, 10765, 10759, 9648, 80], "popularity": 3.4553, "vote_count": 41, "poster_path": "/pNqWrcUbJgBqiefyTGxRl0NQ9NK.jpg", "vote_average": 7.6, "backdrop_path": "/aPQ1ul1PLbYsC0VjcIOaofH7AZ2.jpg", "original_name": "Persona4 the ANIMATION", "first_air_date": "2011-10-07", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46423, "name": "Destiny of the Shrine Maiden", "adult": false, "overview": "There is a small town somewhere in Japan, which is surrounded by nature. In this town, there is a large and gorgeous school, Otobashi Gakuen; which was founded to make the students familiar with nature. This story starts off with Kurusugawa Himeko. She is a normal student who goes to Otobashi Gakuen. She leads bright and enjoyable school days with her two friends, Himekawa Chikane and Oogami Souma. Chikane is the only daughter of a distinguished family. She excels at both academics and sports. She is also kind and beautiful, making her very popular among the other students. Oogami Souma is Himeko’s childhood friend. He has problems expressing his emotions directly, but he is very sincere. On Himeko's 16th birthday, a dark moon blocks out the sun, and the Orochi come forth to destroy the world. But why are they targetting Himeko...?", "genre_ids": [16, 18, 10765], "popularity": 2.341, "vote_count": 11, "poster_path": "/xUveLutu5d9nbJr94XyyF0QjOzh.jpg", "vote_average": 6.2, "backdrop_path": "/cXgzwd0ORzZVjMRRcl9Ic3OVcJr.jpg", "original_name": "神無月の巫女", "first_air_date": "2004-10-01", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 318, "name": "American Gothic", "adult": false, "overview": "Everything is not what it seems in Trinity, South Carolina. Sheriff Lucas Buck develops a sinister interest in Caleb. Caleb's cousin Gail tries to protect him, but that's complicated since she has feelings for Sheriff Buck. And Caleb's dead sister, Merlyn, returns as an angel, warning him that Buck is an incarnation of evil - and may not be human.", "genre_ids": [10765, 18, 80], "popularity": 2.7776, "vote_count": 55, "poster_path": "/qajOMTtQ958JEpmokPXTruwA9qp.jpg", "vote_average": 7.327, "backdrop_path": "/itisXkOIsntQacvuO5BF05xHJ60.jpg", "original_name": "American Gothic", "first_air_date": "1995-09-22", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 250300, "name": "Even If I Could Find You In My Dreams", "adult": false, "overview": "Webseries directed by Shunji Iwai.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 0.497, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/rYG3JLhWkFPKTak7xOCGwRZwO1X.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "夢で会えても", "first_air_date": "2020-12-05", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 250446, "name": "The Name of the Game Is a Kidnapping", "adult": false, "overview": "Shunsuke Sakuma works with numerous clients as a planner for an advertising agency. He is somewhat of a mysterious man and popular with women. He deals with his work and his personal life in the same manner, like he is playing a game. He is currently working on a large project involving a car company. The project is progressing well, but he is suddenly excluded from the project by the car company's vice president, Katsutoshi Katsuragi. Shunsuke Sakuma’s pride is wounded from his exclusion and he becomes extremely upset at that. He happens to meet Juri Katsuragi who is Katsutoshi Katsuragi’s daughter. She also holds a grudge against her father. Shunsuke Sakuma and Juri Katsuragi decides to team up to get revenge. They take part in a kidnapping game.", "genre_ids": [9648, 18], "popularity": 2.4811, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/z5CRjPPMGlxcKhUkY0w9Qx0JLfA.jpg", "vote_average": 6, "backdrop_path": "/ezEnzklrBiXfU44zEVoFJrQoLF7.jpg", "original_name": "ゲームの名は誘拐", "first_air_date": "2024-06-09", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 226261, "name": "Bye Bye, My Friend", "adult": false, "overview": "This coming-of-age drama follows Hayakawa Mai, a contract worker with aspirations of becoming a novelist. After her agency terminates her contract, she begins to lose hope in her dreams. However, a chance reunion with her best friend from high school, whom she hasn't seen in ten years, helps her regain her positivity. Despite this, Mai struggles with guilt over her past actions towards her friend.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 0.8956, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/83F4jLwbt0EFvAwtf3YqzW760Ek.jpg", "vote_average": 7, "backdrop_path": "/5GhAeX54yZYzv2ytvjBR1vsnyEn.jpg", "original_name": "バイバイ、マイフレンド", "first_air_date": "2023-05-10", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 226294, "name": "The Love of Hypnosis", "adult": false, "overview": "The story begins when a white-collar worker discovers old records in her childhood home which takes the story to the end of Qing and the beginning of the Republican era. The female protagonist is a woman with a unique ability and a special mission. She can help men and women through their emotional problems and leave them with no regrets regardless of the outcome. Yet her own experience with love is not without troubles of its own.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 0.8312, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/udOimRll5LH5fh6sr61lrrl1jzq.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": "/4Do8fiNtRnOfjQ0BLX2MPhkjGso.jpg", "original_name": "南烟斋笔录", "first_air_date": "", "origin_country": ["CN"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 226340, "name": "Fear the Walking Dead: Dead in the Water", "adult":