ving transforming superhero, a young man who attains super powers and is tasked to defend earth from the evil plans of a galactic conqueror. Known in the West as Goldwing, Gold Wing 123 is one of Korea's earliest and most classic animated films.  The Gold Wing 123 was mastered in HD for Blu-ray release, but some imperfections still exist in the film due to the state of the original archive print.", "genre_ids": [28, 12, 16, 878], "popularity": 0.1812, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/fP9Q93PDAJTzUDNzNwm4QKVsn6y.jpg", "release_date": "1978-05-01", "vote_average": 7.8, "backdrop_path": "/rRWxdu08roj26gX5lt4cB7VtDMY.jpg", "original_title": "Hwang Geumnalgae 1.2.3.", "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 529106, "adult": false, "title": "Major Grom: Plague Doctor", "video": false, "overview": "In present day St. Petersburg, police major Igor Grom, an honest and skilled cop with unconventional methods, pursues a vigilante murderer in the mask of a plague doctor.", "genre_ids": [28, 12], "popularity": 3.9991, "vote_count": 618, "poster_path": "/4PsiX8or0QHg3LKLbh4VyF0bLj1.jpg", "release_date": "2021-04-01", "vote_average": 6.7, "backdrop_path": "/1sEtjLhUyM5z3P1fSYTm6eTQdm8.jpg", "original_title": "Майор Гром: Чумной Доктор", "original_language": "ru"}, {"id": 675353, "adult": false, "title": "Sonic the Hedgehog 2", "video": false, "overview": "After settling in Green Hills, Sonic is eager to prove he has what it takes to be a true hero. His test comes when Dr. Robotnik returns, this time with a new partner, Knuckles, in search for an emerald that has the power to destroy civilizations. Sonic teams up with his own sidekick, Tails, and together they embark on a globe-trotting journey to find the emerald before it falls into the wrong hands.", "genre_ids": [28, 12, 10751, 35], "popularity": 10.608, "vote_count": 5661, "poster_path": "/6DrHO1jr3qVrViUO6s6kFiAGM7.jpg", "release_date": "2022-03-30", "vote_average": 7.4, "backdrop_path": "/xuLA0pii2IMJW2puT7EvJtgpg0H.jpg", "origi