l War rages on between the Union and the Confederacy, three men – a quiet loner, a ruthless hitman, and a Mexican bandit – comb the American Southwest in search of a strongbox containing $200,000 in stolen gold.", "genre_ids": [37], "popularity": 12.3803, "vote_count": 9203, "poster_path": "/bX2xnavhMYjWDoZp1VM6VnU1xwe.jpg", "release_date": "1966-12-22", "vote_average": 8.463, "backdrop_path": "/x4biAVdPVCghBlsVIzB6NmbghIz.jpg", "original_title": "Il buono, il brutto, il cattivo", "original_language": "it"}, {"id": 335, "adult": false, "title": "Once Upon a Time in the West", "video": false, "overview": "As the railroad builders advance unstoppably through the Arizona desert on their way to the sea, Jill arrives in the small town of Flagstone with the intention of starting a new life.", "genre_ids": [18, 37], "popularity": 8.3661, "vote_count": 4649, "poster_path": "/qbYgqOczabWNn2XKwgMtVrntD6P.jpg", "release_date": "1968-12-21", "vote_average": 8.28, "backdrop_path": "/p1OFxsff2t8bxQC45TPfyo0ZBfU.jpg", "original_title": "C'era una volta il West", "original_language": "it"}, {"id": 336, "adult": false, "title": "Duck, You Sucker", "video": false, "overview": "At the beginning of the 1913 Mexican Revolution, greedy bandit Juan Miranda and idealist John H. Mallory, an Irish Republican Army explosives expert on the lam from the British, fall in with a band of revolutionaries plotting to strike a national bank. When it turns out that the government has been using the bank as a hiding place for illegally detained political prisoners -- who are freed by the blast -- Miranda becomes a revolutionary hero against his will.", "genre_ids": [37], "popularity": 3.1977, "vote_count": 1129, "poster_path": "/l91bdMjPYUXRLjOnBosxCGickKa.jpg", "release_date": "1971-10-29", "vote_average": 7.7, "backdrop_path": "/2ZbYjD4j3RzUZ7PvPb8toKQeF4.jpg", "original_title": "Giù la testa", "original_language": "it"}, {"id": 391, "adult": false, "title": "A Fistful of Dollars", "video": false, "o