le for pet supremacy. The fur flies as the feline faction, led by Mr. Tinkles, squares off against wide-eyed puppy Lou and his canine cohorts.", "genre_ids": [10751, 35, 28, 12, 14], "popularity": 3.0094, "vote_count": 1685, "poster_path": "/77dmCJelVTBPBwbTppiisQx0e82.jpg", "release_date": "2001-07-04", "vote_average": 5.388, "backdrop_path": "/3ipuPBeBfsxcsry7Gh5m9J1rwJ1.jpg", "original_title": "Cats & Dogs", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 11004, "adult": false, "title": "Wonder Boys", "video": false, "overview": "Grady is a 50-ish English professor who hasn't had a thing published in years—not since he wrote his award winning 'Great American Novel' 7 years ago. This weekend proves even worse than he could imagine as he finds himself reeling from one misadventure to another in the company of a new wonder boy author.", "genre_ids": [35, 18], "popularity": 2.5217, "vote_count": 626, "poster_path": "/xktXTvdAizvEfHQozXPKVYPcyEP.jpg", "release_date": "2000-02-22", "vote_average": 6.833, "backdrop_path": "/f6axPiSzkPa2ErTtTxBUGfCLFPd.jpg", "original_title": "Wonder Boys", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 11007, "adult": false, "title": "Cheaper by the Dozen", "video": false, "overview": "The Baker brood moves to Chicago after patriarch Tom gets a job coaching football at Northwestern University, forcing his writer wife, Kate, and the couple's 12 children to make a major adjustment. The transition works well until work demands pull the parents away from home, leaving the kids bored -- and increasingly mischievous.", "genre_ids": [35, 10751, 18], "popularity": 4.2196, "vote_count": 2860, "poster_path": "/dQyP6TuKmB0JIKvnl0UznvaRcPB.jpg", "release_date": "2003-12-24", "vote_average": 6.281, "backdrop_path": "/h1jqCWsSWudxQv7uYguDkXaAjPF.jpg", "original_title": "Cheaper by the Dozen", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 11024, "adult": false, "title": "Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed", "video": false, "overview": "A masked villain wreaks mayhem on the city of Coolsville with a monster machine that creates real-life versions of Mystery Inc.'s former foes like The 10,000 Volt Ghost, The Cotton Candy Glob, The Skelemen and The Pterodactyl Ghost. Fred, Daphne, Shaggy, Velma and Scooby-Doo launch an investigation into the monster outbreak that leaves Shaggy and Scooby questioning their roles in Mystery Inc. Eager to prove their detective skills, the ever-ravenous duo comes up with a secret plan to solve the mystery all by themselves. Can the gang unravel their most challenging case?", "genre_ids": [9648, 14, 12, 35], "popularity": 4.6975, "vote_count": 2822, "poster_path": "/5BrXCJrs22bR5KR6mLHluYo6y4m.jpg", "release_date": "2004-03-24", "vote_average": 6.1, "backdrop_path": "/m8y7OjvCBLmJfG6CIb5gpXFSLec.jpg", "original_title": "Scooby-Doo 2: Monsters Unleashed", "original_language": "en"}], "total_pages": 14460, "total_results": 289194}, "tagline": "Back in badness.", "homepage": "https://www.thebadguysmovie.com", "overview": "The now-reformed Bad Guys are trying (very, very hard) to be good, but instead find themselves hijacked into a high-stakes, globe-trotting heist, masterminded by a new team of criminals they never saw coming: The Bad Girls.", "popularity": 63.9481, "vote_count": 466, "poster_path": "/c1msaKf1wyuKcmLjjJd6rIBPFcd.jpg", "release_date": "2025-07-24", "vote_average": 7.797, "backdrop_path": "/lB96EMr5A7Og81UhyldJvvy35r.jpg", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_title": "The Bad Guys 2", "spoken_languages": [{"name": "English", "iso_639_1": "en", "english_name": "English"}], "original_language": "en", "production_companies": [{"id": 521, "name": "DreamWorks Animation", "logo_path": "/3BPX5VGBov8SDqTV7wC1L1xShAS.png", "origin_country": "US"}], "production_countries": [{"name": "United States of America", "iso_3166_1": "US"}], "belongs_to_collection": {"id": 1231053, "name": "The Bad Guys Collection", "poster_path": "/MvnERW28KnZ5fmxS73a27m3qhN.jpg", "backdrop_path": "/m4WprwbsvC1HsORjSiZmiARy9yl.jpg"}}	2025-10-17 10: