"name": "Xbox One", "abbreviation": "XONE"}, {"id": 130, "name": "Nintendo Switch", "abbreviation": "Switch"}], "storyline": "When a simple-minded individual named Stanley discovers that the co-workers in his office have mysteriously vanished, he sets off to find answers.\\n\\nYou will play as Stanley, and you will not play as Stanley. You will make a choice, and you will have your choices taken from you. The game will end, the game will never end. Contradiction follows contradiction, the rules of how games should work are broken, then broken again. You are not here to win. The Stanley Parable is a game that plays you.\\n\\nIn The Stanley Parable: Ultra Deluxe, everything you remember has been recreated, yet it's different somehow. We've been here before, haven't we? Is Stanley still the same as he was back then? Or is it you who has changed?", "created_at": 1544156026, "game_modes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Single player"}], "updated_at": 1760541244, "age_ratings": [{"id": 168654}, {"id": 126540}, {"id": 126541}, {"id": 75119, "synopsis": "Mild Violence, Mild Themes, Scary Scenes"}, {"id": 75120, "synopsis": "Minor level of violent expression"}], "collections": [1852], "parent_game": {"id": 3035, "name": "The Stanley Parable", "slug": "the-stanley-parable", "cover": {"id": 82089, "image_id": "co1rc9"}, "first_release_date": 1381968000}, "screenshots": [{"id": 759163, "image_id": "scg9rv"}, {"id": 759164, "image_id": "scg9rw"}, {"id": 759165, "image_id": "scg9rx"}, {"id": 759166, "image_id": "scg9ry"}, {"id": 759167, "image_id": "scg9rz"}, {"id": 759168, "image_id": "scg9s0"}], "game_engines": [{"id": 13, "logo": {"id": 147, "image_id": "ge43"}, "name": "Unity", "slug": "unity"}], "rating_count": 168, "time_to_beat": {"normally": 16200}, "total_rating": 85.42032916951976, "release_dates": [{"id": 350739, "date": 1651017600, "human": "Apr 27, 2022", "platform": {"id": 3, "name": "Linux", "abbreviation": "Linux"}}, {"id": 350745, "date": 1651017600, "human": "Apr 27, 2022"