bulldog, also appears in the show, and is Oggy's neighbor.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10762, 10751], "popularity": 11.4659, "vote_count": 355, "poster_path": "/aFAN9aKm0OblOr30ROejJCV8rGf.jpg", "vote_average": 7.446, "backdrop_path": "/fVO7r9tAnauny8DAqbetlQ1tVtu.jpg", "original_name": "Oggy et les Cafards", "first_air_date": "1999-09-06", "origin_country": ["FR"], "original_language": "fr"}, {"id": 1567, "name": "CatDog", "adult": false, "overview": "The life and times of a cat and a dog with a unique twist: they're connected, literally. They share one body with a Dog's head at one end and Cat's head on the other. Adding to their dilemma is Cat's annoyance with Dog, mainly caused by Dog's stupidity and Cat's up-tight personality. Characters: Cat - Cat is the smarter one of the two brothers, and is always hatching some kind of plot to get his brother to calm down, so that Cat doesn't get beat around and hurt. Even though most of these plots involve messing with Dog's feeble mind, they often backfire on Cat, much to his dismay. It may not show all the time but, he deeply loves, and cares for his brother Dog. Dog - Dog is the more lovable of the two brothers, Dog loves to play and party and play some more, he loves baseball and playing fetch with frisbees, balls, sticks, etc, He is very friendly, and happy, but does have a breaking point. He's very sensitive, and if he fails at something he feels horrible, and worthless", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10762], "popularity": 10.877, "vote_count": 423, "poster_path": "/fkSCg9negcHAVO3gXohqEidqrsX.jpg", "vote_average": 7.038, "backdrop_path": "/yKHeZmJTFOp4lbWQE0iRKqKhP5X.jpg", "original_name": "CatDog", "first_air_date": "1998-04-04", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 676, "name": "Tom and Jerry Tales", "adult": false, "overview": "Tom and Jerry Tales is an American animated television series featuring the cat-and-mouse duo Tom and Jerry.", "genre_ids": [16, 10762, 35, 10751], "popularity": 6.0606, "vote_count": 139, "poster_path": "/gthxkV1MHAwqsVNLIU93MDm3ApL.jpg", "vote_average": 7.8, "backdrop_path": "/e7gXqszTL2hWhTOkGA1HIJFnSZ0.jpg", "original_name": "Tom and Jerry Tales", "first_air_date": "2006-09-23", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 47480, "name": "The Tom and Jerry Show", "adult": false, "overview": "The iconic cat and mouse rivals are back in a fresh take on the classic series. Preserving the look, characters and sensibility of the original, this series shines a brightly colored, high-definition lens on the madcap slapstick and never-ending battle that has made Tom and Jerry two of the most beloved characters of all time.", "genre_ids": [10751, 16, 35, 10762], "popularity": 18.2745, "vote_count": 104, "poster_path": "/41EWXLXTZO4MLb2BL28mWZuydyq.jpg", "vote_average": 7.3, "backdrop_path": "/utqCOvMmjjMTlXNZz6PHOzRM5QP.jpg", "original_name": "The Tom and Jerry Show", "first_air_date": "2014-04-09", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 504, "name": "The Ren & Stimpy Show", "adult": false, "overview": "Ren and Stimpy are a mismatch made in animation heaven with nothing in common but a life-long friendship and an incredible knack for getting into trouble. Join them in their bizarre and gross world for some outlandish situations coupled with hilarious jokes.", "genre_ids": [16, 10765, 35, 10762, 10751], "popularity": 10.9675, "vote_count": 488, "poster_path": "/4plB7fMf1xob12ui7kpgnO3h4tJ.jpg", "vote_average": 7.628, "backdrop_path": "/c8m4NAE774Vsn5AZvn2bFarUtDX.jpg", "original_name": "The Ren & Stimpy Show", "first_air_date": "1991-08-11", "origin_country": ["CA", "US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 25364, "name": "Bubsy", "adult": false, "overview": "", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10762], "popularity": 0.6192, "vote_count": 5, "poster_path": null, "vote_average": 3.8, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "Bubsy", "first_air_date": "1993-11-28", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id