e cat will learn how to be a surrogate parent. It’s a dream come true for the roaches, who see Piya as a new way to make Oggy’s life miserable.", "poster_path": "/cCrq8nrKTsR0SsAtiEjwjphKDpo.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "episode_count": 78, "season_number": 8}], "similar": {"page": 1, "results": [{"id": 46344, "name": "Kobato.", "adult": false, "overview": "Kobato is a girl who came to earth to fulfill her wish, which is to go to a certain place. To fulfill that wish, she has to find a bottle and fill it with scarred hearts. Together with her \\"teacher\\", which is a stuffed animal, she search for the scarred hearts. However she may not fall in love with any person whom she cures the heart of.", "genre_ids": [16, 18, 10765, 35], "popularity": 2.7975, "vote_count": 12, "poster_path": "/bzE0eksp2MpZh6UWjBBoSxW1Cth.jpg", "vote_average": 9.375, "backdrop_path": "/k4sRP3AuKIqPmjEpxfp5qCCBhxX.jpg", "original_name": "こばと。", "first_air_date": "2009-10-06", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72502, "name": "AHO-GIRL", "adult": false, "overview": "She is Yoshiko Hanabatake, and she's an idiot through and through. She loves bananas, and she loves her childhood friend Akkun. That is all!", "genre_ids": [35, 16], "popularity": 2.908, "vote_count": 181, "poster_path": "/bDclbu2KtIccDQqU7l4TT1m299.jpg", "vote_average": 7.864, "backdrop_path": "/srNNP3nBFDLPLFAII4aOy1VaQUR.jpg", "original_name": "アホガール", "first_air_date": "2017-07-04", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 202318, "name": "Crash Course in Romance", "adult": false, "overview": "The series follows the bittersweet relationship between a banchan shop owner whose daughter enters the war of Korea's college entrance exams, and a top hagwon instructor.", "genre_ids": [18, 35], "popularity": 4.5671, "vote_count": 113, "poster_path": "/88rQREli2xtoDV6HToJysp71ZL7.jpg", "vote_average": 8.2, "backdrop_path": "/16M5khLLfZJCb2y9JlyujiGPPBQ.jpg", "original_name": "일타 스캔들", "first_air_date": "2023-01-14", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 49307, "name": "Cyclops Girl Cypu", "adult": false, "overview": "When Fuuka hit her second year of middle school, puberty kicked in. Now she's really tall and has huge boobs. Due to her hairstyle, her classmates call her \\"Saipu\\", after the cyclops. Her affection for her older brother was cute when she was a little girl and said she wanted to marry him. Now it just freaks him out, since she's decided she's adult enough to follow through on her childish promises.", "genre_ids": [16, 35], "popularity": 1.5113, "vote_count": 44, "poster_path": "/j9h1MKl8G2D88sX67xNoVaJe2e6.jpg", "vote_average": 7.2, "backdrop_path": "/29CKrUyTxES06KkLDDvHnZih60a.jpg", "original_name": "サイクロプス少女さいぷ～", "first_air_date": "2013-03-12", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 967, "name": "The Huckleberry Hound Show", "adult": false, "overview": "The Huckleberry Hound Show is a 1958 syndicated animated series and the second from Hanna-Barbera following The Ruff & Reddy Show, sponsored by Kellogg's. Three segments were included in the program: one featuring Huckleberry Hound; another starring Yogi Bear and his sidekick Boo Boo; and a third with Pixie and Dixie and Mr. Jinks, two mice who in each short found a new way to outwit the cat Mr. Jinks.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10762], "popularity": 4.2026, "vote_count": 133, "poster_path": "/aCINquTur6BE7bEa7Fzk0qcdWYN.jpg", "vote_average": 6.8, "backdrop_path": "/1lTXCp8kMqBT5TQF3no2pjA3MZ2.jpg", "original_name": "The Huckleberry Hound Show", "first_air_date": "1958-09-29", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 974, "name": "Raw Toonage", "adult": false, "overview": "Disney's Raw Toonage is a half-hour Disney animated cartoon series that aired on the CBS network in the fall of 1992.", "genre_ids": [16], "popularity": 2.4162, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/A1IyXZFIiXPMA4y7SvH9FEcSvl.jpg", "vote_average": 8.2, "backdrop_