ader of his Valley of Peace, but also needs someone to take his place as Dragon Warrior. As such, he will train a new kung fu practitioner for the spot and will encounter a villain called the Chameleon who conjures villains from the past.", "popularity": 22.7488, "vote_count": 3245, "poster_path": "/kDp1vUBnMpe8ak4rjgl3cLELqjU.jpg", "release_date": "2024-03-02", "vote_average": 7.037, "backdrop_path": "/kYgQzzjNis5jJalYtIHgrom0gOx.jpg", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_title": "Kung Fu Panda 4", "spoken_languages": [{"name": "English", "iso_639_1": "en", "english_name": "English"}], "original_language": "en", "production_companies": [{"id": 521, "name": "DreamWorks Animation", "logo_path": "/3BPX5VGBov8SDqTV7wC1L1xShAS.png", "origin_country": "US"}], "production_countries": [{"name": "United States of America", "iso_3166_1": "US"}], "belongs_to_collection": {"id": 77816, "name": "Kung Fu Panda Collection", "poster_path": "/xoYc0RYKSc3xC4S9OpPZxKocKtj.jpg", "backdrop_path": "/2nbtv33hEk2CTnuMhTGZgsFdi3K.jpg"}}	2025-10-17 10:31:19.853	2025-10-17 10:32:05.442	\N	\N
