esent-day owner of the chateau, further complicates the matter.", "genre_ids": [35, 14], "popularity": 2.2422, "vote_count": 1030, "poster_path": "/c1xMb4GfTuyKSRUoeewBF27dtKa.jpg", "release_date": "1998-02-11", "vote_average": 6.018, "backdrop_path": "/8PoskoYT4QQqE7MtExsK0oS9yp9.jpg", "original_title": "Les Couloirs du temps : Les Visiteurs II", "original_language": "fr"}, {"id": 10372, "adult": false, "title": "Ewoks: The Battle for Endor", "video": false, "overview": "The army of the Marauders, led by King Terak and the witch Charal, attack the Ewoks village, killing Cindel's family. Cindel and the Ewok Wicket escape and meet Teek in the forest, a naughty and very fast animal. Teek takes them to a house in which an old man, Noa, lives. Like Cindel, he also crashed with his Starcruiser on Endor. Together they fight Terak and Charal.", "genre_ids": [12, 10751, 10770, 878, 14], "popularity": 2.1089, "vote_count": 333, "poster_path": "/ntgKdekb7xMKscyh2Hei706LBLf.jpg", "release_date": "1985-11-24", "vote_average": 5.434, "backdrop_path": "/xdH8k2O6mpLv4szeLkQGiM1aSOC.jpg", "original_title": "Ewoks: The Battle for Endor", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 10380, "adult": false, "title": "An American Tail: Fievel Goes West", "video": false, "overview": "Some time after the Mousekewitz's have settled in America, they find that they are still having problems with the threat of cats. That makes them eager to try another home out in the west, where they are promised that mice and cats live in peace. Unfortunately, the one making this claim is an oily con artist named Cat R. Waul who is intent on his own sinister plan.", "genre_ids": [16, 10751, 37, 12, 35], "popularity": 4.3771, "vote_count": 765, "poster_path": "/k4aLupAkHWwHiEDwvqsZFAnUYF.jpg", "release_date": "1991-11-21", "vote_average": 6.334, "backdrop_path": "/8UpJ8svNnwVtpu8n62vGke8MOJf.jpg", "original_title": "An American Tail: Fievel Goes West", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 10391, "adult": false, "title":