296157	\N	\N	ELDEN RING Reforged (ERR) is a mod by Kirnifr and ivi, with assistance from Poeconcept, Hanalove and Cavou. ERR is a thorough revision of ELDEN RING's balance and mechanics. The mod covers enemies, boss fights, hitboxes, animations, equipment, the camera, and more. Main features include unique camera parameters for boss fights, improved enemy hitboxes, reworked scaling and leveling, a new Runeforging system to encourage open world exploration and make NG+ more rewarding, changed gameplay mechanics that fix many of the vanilla game's issues, new Spells and Weapons, and more!	\N	\N	\N	null	null	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	null	[{"id": 2, "name": "Third person"}]	null	[{"id": 628679, "url": "https://err.fandom.com/wiki/ELDEN_RING_Reforged_Wiki"}, {"id": 628678, "url": "https://www.nexusmods.com/eldenring/mods/541?tab=description"}]	null	2025-10-17 08:32:23.245	2025-10-17 08:32:23.245
