as a strong impression that something is haunting her.", "genre_ids": [27, 53], "popularity": 0.2068, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/dttiCmY8uVrUyES8wbqQbPnYSLa.jpg", "release_date": "2015-10-16", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": null, "original_title": "笔仙魔咒", "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 529149, "adult": false, "title": "Darlin'", "video": false, "overview": "Found at a Catholic hospital filthy and ferocious, feral teenager Darlin’ is whisked off to a care home run by The Bishop and his obedient nuns, where she’s to be rehabilitated into a \\"good girl\\" as an example of the miraculous work of the church. But Darlin’ holds a secret darker than the \\"sins\\" she is threatened with, and she is not traveling alone. The Woman who raised her, equally fierce and feral, is ever present in the shadows of Darlin’s psyche and is determined to come for her no matter who tries to get in her way.", "genre_ids": [27, 53, 9648], "popularity": 2.2366, "vote_count": 138, "poster_path": "/tOuEt2m2YpHwQVybfxdSFq6s1Cy.jpg", "release_date": "2019-09-11", "vote_average": 5.308, "backdrop_path": "/jkT48BVib90GwExSQ01jqxzROWT.jpg", "original_title": "Darlin'", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 675353, "adult": false, "title": "Sonic the Hedgehog 2", "video": false, "overview": "After settling in Green Hills, Sonic is eager to prove he has what it takes to be a true hero. His test comes when Dr. Robotnik returns, this time with a new partner, Knuckles, in search for an emerald that has the power to destroy civilizations. Sonic teams up with his own sidekick, Tails, and together they embark on a globe-trotting journey to find the emerald before it falls into the wrong hands.", "genre_ids": [28, 12, 10751, 35], "popularity": 10.608, "vote_count": 5661, "poster_path": "/6DrHO1jr3qVrViUO6s6kFiAGM7.jpg", "release_date": "2022-03-30", "vote_average": 7.4, "backdrop_path": "/xuLA0pii2IMJW2puT7EvJtgpg0H.jpg", "original_title": "Sonic the Hedgehog 2", "original_language": "en"}, {"i