3933	null	null	null	{"page": 1, "results": [{"id": 389862, "adult": false, "title": "How Dark the Nights Are on the Black Sea", "video": false, "overview": "In this farcical dark comedy/melodrama, Lena manages to lose her place at college by virtue of throwing a minor hissy-fit when she catches her erstwhile boyfriend in bed with another girl. Instead of penalizing the boy for his behavior, Lena gets stuck with a court appearance and must pay a small fine, in addition to losing a boyfriend, her college career, and an apartment. Lena belongs to a film club which occasionally hands out awards, and the membership of it decides to send her into the Russian hinterlands to hand out an award to an obscure filmmaker. Throughout the film, Lena has been associated with a bizarre con man named Stepanych who, when his cons fall through, comes to her in the distant town she has gone to seeking her help in committing suicide.", "genre_ids": [35, 10749], "popularity": 0.0841, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/vWM3vitSOd9zf9IKvn8UEjwecId.jpg", "release_date": "1989-03-25", "vote_average": 3.8, "backdrop_path": "/zvirPUc2icShoJ2FeWKMi3bsZEe.jpg", "original_title": "В городе Сочи тёмные ночи", "original_language": "ru"}, {"id": 389876, "adult": false, "title": "Helen Keller: Angel of Love and Light", "video": false, "overview": "Based on the story of Helen Keller who at a very young age was left deaf and blinded by an illness. But she fought through the obstacles, trying to live a normal life as possible. She became on of the first disabled rights-pioneers.", "genre_ids": [16, 10770, 36], "popularity": 1.9276, "vote_count": 5, "poster_path": "/dpbcfSeIvmPCkERN8k8lwfGXUaB.jpg", "release_date": "1981-05-05", "vote_average": 5, "backdrop_path": "/kKPUswpoXc5qgRLOl7ZutODCOcn.jpg", "original_title": "ヘレン・ケラー物語 愛と光の天使", "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 1445031, "adult": false, "title": "Three Loves", "video": false, "overview": "Lena, a 40-year-old actress freshly divorced, is determined