tract to end in ultra-violence, Koko and her comrades in arms bring the boom to every corner of the world.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 18], "popularity": 3.6571, "vote_count": 72, "poster_path": "/2v886zu4uziTmmtjRWXaWjf1QeU.jpg", "vote_average": 7.7, "backdrop_path": "/nk8vzXp3JFCHgqwqX1oGzvOjEtz.jpg", "original_name": "ヨルムンガンド", "first_air_date": "2012-04-10", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46283, "name": "Blast of Tempest", "adult": false, "overview": "The Kusaribe family is a family of sorcerers under the protection of the ‘Tree of Origins.’ Their princess, Hakaze Kusaribe, was the greatest sorceress of their family. But Samon Kusaribe, a member of their family seeking to resurrect the ‘Tree of World's End,’ a tree that opposes the ‘Tree of Origins’ and controls the power of destruction, stuffs her into a barrel, and banishes her to a deserted island.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16, 10765], "popularity": 3.0381, "vote_count": 96, "poster_path": "/iUU9HoXlExmFCEO8p9oceJqYlDP.jpg", "vote_average": 8, "backdrop_path": "/gAqAdxCOS0Rdo7agYhG1qU7OMou.jpg", "original_name": "絶園のテンペスト", "first_air_date": "2012-10-05", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46298, "name": "Hunter x Hunter", "adult": false, "overview": "To fulfill his dreams of becoming a legendary Hunter like his dad, a young boy must pass a rigorous examination and find his missing father.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 10765], "popularity": 43.719, "vote_count": 1952, "poster_path": "/i2EEr2uBvRlAwJ8d8zTG2Y19mIa.jpg", "vote_average": 8.7, "backdrop_path": "/6U0e6OHklJAcMAuIoGXjTBS5zsI.jpg", "original_name": "HUNTER×HUNTER", "first_air_date": "2011-10-02", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46302, "name": "Maoyu: Archenemy & Hero", "adult": false, "overview": "The story is set in a world embroiled by war between Humans and Demons. The Humans’ greatest hero invades the Demon Queen’s castle determined to vanquish her. However, instead of fighting back, the Queen proposes an alliance with the Hero. She explains how a sudden end to the war can bring further chaos to the world as the Humans once united to stand against their common enemies would eventually begin fighting among themselves, with similar issues already occurring at the Demon Realm. Convinced by her words, the Hero joins forces with the Queen and together they execute a plan to bring prosperity and a lasting peace to both Humans and Demons alike.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10765, 10759], "popularity": 3.0651, "vote_count": 46, "poster_path": "/GMPYCitK7L429czVhcPdfHu6N6.jpg", "vote_average": 7.739, "backdrop_path": "/1jUOZbFhjo3GyLhQEfhy59jCXhr.jpg", "original_name": "まおゆう魔王勇者", "first_air_date": "2013-01-05", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46314, "name": "Zombie-Loan", "adult": false, "overview": "Based on the manga by PEACH-PIT, serialised in G-Fantasy. When a human is marked to die, a faint gray line that is invisible to most appears around their neck. As time passes, that ring becomes darker and darker, until it is eventually black, and that person dies. Kita Michiru has an unusual gift - she posses \\"Shinigami eyes,\\" which allow her to see these rings. When Michiru notices that two of the boys in her Class, Akatsuki Chika and Tachibana Shito not only have rings, but that they`re jet black, they reveal to her that the were supposed to die in a tragic accident six months ago. With the help of the Zombie Loan loan office, they were given a second chance at life, should they be able to pay for their debt by doing the work of Shinigami and killing malicious zombies. They petition Michiru to assist them in their efforts, and she finds her everyday life changing dramatically.", "genre_ids": [16, 10765, 35, 18, 9648], "popularity": 2.262, "vote_count": 8, "poster_path": "/9A8cVFEYvO1OwrGjezunFMc5o66.jpg", "vote_average": 5.7, "backdrop_path": "/sMfNR2TXb0ECIh7y6IDLorPOfND.jpg", "original_name": "ゾンビローン", "first_air_date": "2007-07-03", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46315, "name": "Touka Gettan", "adult": false, "overview": "Touka Gettan is set in the land of Kamitsumihara, where traces of  magic and legend can still be seen. The land has been under the  protection of the Kamiazuma clan since it was founded. The story  revolves around Tōka Kamiazuma, the main protagonist, and his encounter  with a young girl named Momoka Kawakabe who comes to stay with the clan.  Their meeting sets off a chain of events that will bring an ancient  legend to life.", "genre_ids": [16, 9648, 18, 35, 10765], "popularity": 1.6848, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/gxoj6rLHdp0evKCl954ZGbPQYZw.jpg", "vote_average": 6, "backdrop_path": "/dAkLKxZYlwcvPRF83039A7mhA1b.jpg", "original_name": "桃華月憚", "first_air_date": "2007-04-02", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46337, "name": "Cross Game", "adult": false, "overview": "Kō Kitamura, whose family owns a sporting goods store, has known the Tsukishima  girls since he was born. The Tsukishima family runs a batting center and  cafe, and they have four daughters. There's Ichiyo, the responsible  eldest; Wakaba, Kō's cheerful best friend; Aoba, who doesn't get along  with Kō; and Momiji, the energetic youngest daughter. When Kō enters high school, he aspires to lead his baseball team to the  Koshien National High School Championship as their ace pitcher and make  Wakaba's dream come true.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 18, 10749], "popularity": 4.1976, "vote_count": 21, "poster_path": "/3M701nra5h9ChMjT1ACOPfJqQnv.jpg", "vote_average": 8.6, "backdrop_path": "/wyolXbJmRAlW1rU7G1zOC1O9XQx.jpg", "original_name": "クロスゲーム", "first_air_date": "2009-04-05", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46338, "name": "Silent Möbius", "adult": false, "overview": "The year is 2023 and Alien Beings known as \\"Lucifer Hawks\\" have begun invading earth from another dimension. All that stands between them and the enslavement of the human race is the Attacked Mystification Police Department - a special division of the Tokyo Police staffed by women with amazing paranormal abilities.", "genre_ids": [18, 10765, 16], "popularity": 3.3088, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/xgcWmpOAdbEjxzrtSN25v6mKCBb.jpg", "vote_average": 6.5, "backdrop_path": "/x9VeHGJ1Hv7RbbPDAJsxsK0o2QS.jpg", "original_name": "サイレントメビウス", "first_air_date": "1998-04-07", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46342, "name": "Okamikakushi: Masque of the Wolf", "adult": false, "overview": "Kuzumi Hiroshi moves with his crippled sister and his father to  the remote city of Jouga, which is famous for its hassaku citrus and the  rumors that a species of enormous wolves once lived in the area. While  some of the residents are more than friendly, when people begin to  vanish suddenly, it becomes apparent that something sinister is afoot...", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 9648], "popularity": 1.805, "vote_count": 9, "poster_path": "/bH6m58wqVYpeDkar8zp2pw4RN8o.jpg", "vote_average": 8.7, "backdrop_path": "/nqmWVA0rP7zTrGQtCZKLqbJVXxy.jpg", "original_name": "おおかみかくし", "first_air_date": "2010-01-07", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46344, "name": "Kobato.", "adult": false, "overview": "Kobato is a girl who came to earth to fulfill her wish, which is to go to a certain place. To fulfill that wish, she has to find a bottle and fill it with scarred hearts. Together with her \\"teacher\\", which is a stuffed animal, she search for the scarred hearts. However she may not fall in love with any person whom she cures the heart of.", "genre_ids": [16, 18, 10765, 35], "popularity": 2.7975, "vote_count": 12, "poster_path": "/bzE0eksp2MpZh6UWjBBoSxW1Cth.jpg", "vote_average": 9.375, "backdrop_path": "/k4sRP3AuKIqPmjEpxfp5qCCBhxX.jpg", "original_name": "こばと。", "first_air_date": "2009-10-06", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46345, "name": "Tokyo Mew Mew", "adult": false, "overview": "On her first date with the cutest boy in school, Ichigo is zapped by a  mysterious ray that scrambles her DNA with that of the endangered Iriomote wildcat. The next day, Ichigo discovers that she has developed the agility (and occasionally the ears and tail) of a cat, as well as the power to transform into a pink-haired superheroine, Mew Ichigo. She and four other girls, each endowed with the genes of a different \\"Red Data\\" animal, have been selected for the top-secret Mew Project, which aims to protect the Earth from an alien menace known as Deep Blue.", "genre_ids": [16, 10762, 10765, 10759, 35, 10751], "popularity": 5.0669, "vote_count": 107, "poster_path": "/vEBuze5ULPfMYfMX8BYuVa2moRs.jpg", "vote_average": 7.6, "backdrop_path": "/ijLRv7VZzLhYiEt7UiBQowlVscr.jpg", "original_name": "東京ミュウミュウ", "first_air_date": "2002-04-06", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46348, "name": "Attack Number One", "adult": false, "overview": "The story is about Kozue Ayuhara, a girl who transferred to Fujimi College and tried out for the school volleyball team. She develops a friendship with her teammate Midori Hayakawa, and her talents impress coach Hongō more and more each day. Though she showcases extraordinary volleyball skills, she makes enemies with Yoshimura, the star of the current team. Kozue discovers that being at the top would bring stress, incompatibilities and other dilemmas into her life. Her high expectations of becoming the best volleyball player in the school, Japan and eventually the world, set the tone for the drama to follow.", "genre_ids": [16, 18], "popularity": 3.6311, "vote_count": 16, "poster_path": "/ubdlKL4ejScebWB6dmLpwCtXQUH.jpg", "vote_average": 5.781, "backdrop_path": "/wni5nJzWRW4bZQYNMTlP98nujcD.jpg", "original_name": "アタックNo.1", "first_air_date": "1969-12-07", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46350, "name": "Yakitate!! Japan", "adult": false, "overview": "Azuma Kazuma isn't terribly clever, but he's got a good heart and  great skill - at baking. Since childhood, he's been on a quest to create  the perfect bread to represent Japan internationally. Now, he seeks to  enter the famous bakery Pantasia, in hopes of reaching his goal. But  plots abound...", "genre_ids": [16, 35], "popularity": 5.8709, "vote_count": 16, "poster_path": "/5FwUqjpiYxfnTxMwjYaVd5Wd8Wp.jpg", "vote_average": 7.2, "backdrop_path": "/zpUHUVLgpzDzNkDHsMHRwGZETEg.jpg", "original_name": "焼きたて!!ジャぱん", "first_air_date": "2004-10-12", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46374, "name": "Katanagatari", "adult": false, "overview": "The legendary swordsmith Kiki Shikizaki created 1,000 swords in his career. The more of the swords a country owns, the higher its chances are at winning a war. When the shogun emerged victorious, he collected 988 swords, but these were merely the “practice pieces”. The last twelve swords were the crowning achievements of Kiki’s career. Each one of them is so powerful that a single man could defeat an army with it.\\n\\nTogame, the shogun’s strategist, gets the order to collect these swords. At first she hired a ninja, but each of the swords’ value is so high that the entire ninja clan went rogue once they got hold of one. She then put her trust in another warrior, but he kept the sword for himself. Her final hope now is Shichika, the seventh and last student of the Kyotoryuu School.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16, 18], "popularity": 2.7127, "vote_count": 54, "poster_path": "/ii4D1K3XJvOLQuaYcP0Oh3mL6JC.jpg", "vote_average": 7.38, "backdrop_path": "/aMqe9Ne9Rx3HZa3sdquqWnTmAQL.jpg", "original_name": "刀語", "first_air_date": "2010-01-25", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46387, "name": "Shining Hearts", "adult": false, "overview": "One day, a mysterious girl named Kaguya was washed ashore the island of Wyndaria after a great storm. She encounters Rick, a swordsman who wound up working at the island's bakery. Apparently, Kaguya is suffering from having lost her memories and emotions. In addition, the usually peaceful Wyndaria is now swarming with pirates who came seeking for the special spirit stone that is worn around Kaguya's neck. Knowing the situation, Rick and his co-workers, Nellis, Amyl, and Aerie decided to bring back peace to island and help Kaguya regain her lost memories and emotions.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16], "popularity": 1.6473, "vote_count": 5, "poster_path": "/oeEneTqn0nxXNViOheziMkbI78P.jpg", "vote_average": 6, "backdrop_path": "/1PfcriAafBHHzUNurKbIHjGYcUn.jpg", "original_name": "シャイニング・ハーツ 〜幸せのパン〜", "first_air_date": "2012-04-13", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46388, "name": "PERSONA 4 the Animation", "adult": false, "overview": "When Yu Narukami moves to the rural country town of Inaba to live with his uncle while his parents are away on business, he's expecting a lot more peace and quiet than he's been used to in the big city. Instead, the peace has been shattered as a rash of mysterious murders and kidnappings sweep the countryside. With the police stymied, Yu finds himself joining with a group of seven other teenagers in a desperate bid to solve the mystery. A mystery that is somehow connected to both the local weather patterns and a strange TV world which Yu, his friends and the enigmatic killer can all enter.", "genre_ids": [16, 10765, 10759, 9648, 80], "popularity": 3.4553, "vote_count": 41, "poster_path": "/pNqWrcUbJgBqiefyTGxRl0NQ9NK.jpg", "vote_average": 7.6, "backdrop_path": "/aPQ1ul1PLbYsC0VjcIOaofH7AZ2.jpg", "original_name": "Persona4 the ANIMATION", "first_air_date": "2011-10-07", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46392, "name": "Duel Masters", "adult": false, "overview": "A mysterious organization is interested in fledging duelist Shobu Kirifuda's ability to bring Duel Master creatures to life. With the support of his friends, Shobu duels with passion, discipline, and heart as he strives to be like his father and become the next Kaijudo master.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16, 10765, 10762], "popularity": 39.7893, "vote_count": 19, "poster_path": "/t5ijeKzOukACRktUfbjuMIlqwfr.jpg", "vote_average": 6.2, "backdrop_path": "/1xlpfYGGFXOlYqQSUlFKEv4hqbt.jpg", "original_name": "デュエル・マスターズ", "first_air_date": "2002-10-21", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46412, "name": "Utawarerumono", "adult": false, "overview": "Hakuoro has lost his memory after succumbing to serious injuries. But thanks to an elderly woman and her granddaughter Eruruu, he is nursed back to health. His face is covered by a strange irremovable mask and he occasionally sees beastly visions. Eruruu now cares for him as he becomes accustomed to the village and its inhabitants, who all bear strange ears (the women also have tails). Though these people venerate the forces of nature, desecration of an altar forces them to take drastic measures to preserve their lives from the wrath of Mutikapa-sama, guardian of the forest.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 10765], "popularity": 8.479, "vote_count": 25, "poster_path": "/9skPAAxMLG25aYROr3UT1JJi9UQ.jpg", "vote_average": 7.3, "backdrop_path": "/61wohujGWIWPRFxereT1o7uCArN.jpg", "original_name": "うたわれるもの", "first_air_date": "2006-04-03", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46414, "name": "Kanokon", "adult": false, "overview": "Kouta has girl troubles of the supernatural sort. For some reason, he keeps attracting the attention (and affections) of animal spirits!\\n\\nHaving spent most of his life in the country, Kouta is understandably nervous when he moves in with his grandma to attend a high school in the big city. He hoped to make a good impression, but having Chizuru, a beautiful fox spirit, hanging off his arm didn't seem to be the sort of image he wanted to have. She's not alone in her love for Kouta, either. Nozomu, a wolf spirit, as well as other youkai have their sights set on the hapless country boy.", "genre_ids": [16, 18, 10765, 35], "popularity": 5.1907, "vote_count": 42, "poster_path": "/iEJU6ZiH5TEsNddFqpJgNnahswn.jpg", "vote_average": 6.7, "backdrop_path": "/z1o6vvFkMmZ5It3Gb3YtFD56KrH.jpg", "original_name": "かのこん", "first_air_date": "2008-04-05", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}], "total_pages": 2311, "total_results": 46216}	2025-10-17 09:06:03.999	2025-10-17 09:06:03.999
