in order to clear his name, Lee must escape from the highly fortified detention room every day, infiltrate a new social clique, and unravel another piece of the gigantic prank puzzle to try to figure out who actually pulled off the epic stunt.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16, 35, 10762, 9648, 10765], "popularity": 2.4573, "vote_count": 12, "poster_path": "/bVX7vadsZNEfUzHXPkNbFdjfvk5.jpg", "vote_average": 7.2, "backdrop_path": "/eEN5mx16Hp9tLRjM16d5TAvcKuP.jpg", "original_name": "Detentionaire", "first_air_date": "2011-09-12", "origin_country": ["CA"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46392, "name": "Duel Masters", "adult": false, "overview": "A mysterious organization is interested in fledging duelist Shobu Kirifuda's ability to bring Duel Master creatures to life. With the support of his friends, Shobu duels with passion, discipline, and heart as he strives to be like his father and become the next Kaijudo master.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16, 10765, 10762], "popularity": 39.7893, "vote_count": 19, "poster_path": "/t5ijeKzOukACRktUfbjuMIlqwfr.jpg", "vote_average": 6.2, "backdrop_path": "/1xlpfYGGFXOlYqQSUlFKEv4hqbt.jpg", "original_name": "デュエル・マスターズ", "first_air_date": "2002-10-21", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46410, "name": "Guess How Much I Love You", "adult": false, "overview": "Based on the books by Sam McBratney, and illustrated by Anita Jeram, Guess How Much I Love You sees Little and Big Nutbrown Hare explore their beautiful surroundings, play with their friends and delight in the love between them. The series not only explores the tender idea of the boundless love between father and son, but opens up their world... a beautiful and pristine valley full of playful friends and delights of nature in every season.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10751], "popularity": 1.6011, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/nwl4WTQTiiYbUZTaBnRPodo2Jl.jpg", "vote_average": 9.5, "backdrop_path": "/dz1IE2ofDb5qo3w2pd2z3f45bRh.jpg", "original_name": "Guess How Much I Love You", "first_air_date": "2012-01-01", "origin_country": ["AU"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46432, "name": "Sabrina: Secrets of a Teenage Witch", "adult": false, "overview": "Sabrina: Secrets of a Teenage Witch is an American animated television series on Hub Network based on the Archie Comics character Sabrina the Teenage Witch. The series is developed by Pamela Hickey and Dennys McCoy and was acquired by Hub Network on October 1, 2012. The series was originally intended for a summer 2013 release but has since been pushed out to fall 2013.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10759, 10765, 10762], "popularity": 1.2867, "vote_count": 8, "poster_path": "/hLr90mN4cPBGadvd5ofZtWIKAIa.jpg", "vote_average": 6.6, "backdrop_path": "/3tR5R1HrvU1St3HfSE8SqR1EIVu.jpg", "original_name": "Sabrina: Secrets of a Teenage Witch", "first_air_date": "2013-10-12", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 72155, "name": "Left-Eye Detective", "adult": false, "overview": "Tanaka Ainosuke was born with a weak left eye. Then one day, his older brother Yumehito dies mysteriously, allowing Ainosuke to receive a cornea transplant from him. After the surgery, whenever there is a shock to his left eye he sees strange images. Ainosuke assumes that the images might be clues to his brother's death and starts an investigation with the help of his junior high school nurse Sayama Hitomi. But just when their probe begins, an unidentified criminal organization appears to disrupt their investigation...", "genre_ids": [9648, 80, 18], "popularity": 0.9931, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/bRIT1uxS8Xho7ZsbiwkwJAAsrd3.jpg", "vote_average": 5.5, "backdrop_path": "/26QGcYEbDfLtB2NuADvxIj0Q5b6.jpg", "original_name": "左目探偵EYE", "first_air_date": "2010-01-23", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72253, "name": "Unhandy Handyman", "adult": false, "overview": "The handymen in an obscure Hokkaido town shut out by the snow are the meddlesome owner Matsui Hideo, the thrice divorced Umemoto Soichi, and the young budding scriptwriter Takeyama Jun who has lost his way. Takeyama had left Tokyo in disgust after an argument with the director on the set over liberties taken with a scene that he had put all his feelings into. He intended to go to Furano where a leading scriptwriter, who dropped out of a drama series midway, lives. However, the bus service has been brought to a standstill by the snowstorm. Takeyama stopped by at a pub in order to fill his stomach. He found himself caught in a great misunderstanding, got drunk and lost both his wallet and mobile phone. Now he has no choice but to stay in this town.", "genre_ids": [35, 18], "popularity": 1.1191, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/esFhiDruuRXPTBvkdzSsboubGBG.jpg", "vote_average": 7.8, "backdrop_path": "/48nCOhusTj128O8h7Cf0FMZ8ylr.jpg", "original_name": "不便な便利屋", "first_air_date": "2015-04-10", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72255, "name": "Ma Boy", "adult": false, "overview": "Jang Geu Rim (Kim So Hyun) is a student at an arts high school who dreams of becoming a pop singer. At school she gets a new roommate, Irene (Sun Woong) who’s actually a boy. Irene’s persona is a pretty Female CF star and his actual name is Hyun Woo.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 0.8095, "vote_count": 13, "poster_path": "/j3TNH3r1VjNr7rGxEip2InBUVGP.jpg", "vote_average": 3.3, "backdrop_path": "/w1Dtmdy4N0Nt1fnKi5wukIow0YT.jpg", "original_name": "마보이", "first_air_date": "2012-08-16", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 178, "name": "My Life as a Teenage Robot", "adult": false, "overview": "Jenny, aka XJ-9, is a super-powered robot with a super-sensitive teenage heart. Her primary function is protecting the planet from disaster, but – like all teenagers – she has her own ideas about how she would like to live her life. Bored with being a superhero, Jenny wants to do something really exciting – like go to high school!", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10759, 10765, 10762], "popularity": 6.5749, "vote_count": 178, "poster_path": "/xHucEYE9gZDCqQA1tZeCJe9x0JN.jpg", "vote_average": 7.413, "backdrop_path": "/cCy8zz9QcI3bzzfMtbvixk7hYmq.jpg", "original_name": "My Life as a Teenage Robot", "first_air_date": "2002-10-18", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 185, "name": "Carnivàle", "adult": false, "overview": "Carnivàle is an American television series set in the United States during the Great Depression and Dust Bowl. In tracing the lives of two disparate groups of people, its overarching story depicts the battle between good and evil and the struggle between free will and destiny; the storyline mixes Christian theology with gnosticism and Masonic lore, particularly that of the Knights Templar.", "genre_ids": [10765, 9648, 18], "popularity": 5.4349, "vote_count": 435, "poster_path": "/5pKvfZ3qLuKJd8PQfKcPxN9jTO9.jpg", "vote_average": 7.917, "backdrop_path": "/gPXlZQr7PR3Ay2pP6XBdvVKmM25.jpg", "original_name": "Carnivàle", "first_air_date": "2003-09-14", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 246, "name": "Avatar: The Last Airbender", "adult": false, "overview": "In a war-torn world of elemental magic, a young boy reawakens to undertake a dangerous mystic quest to fulfill his destiny as the Avatar, and bring peace to the world.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 10765], "popularity": 12.8519, "vote_count": 4500, "poster_path": "/yaGt4GIutpbXHsv48tWceWg6s56.jpg", "vote_average": 8.759, "backdrop_path": "/kU98MbVVgi72wzceyrEbClZmMFe.jpg", "original_name": "Avatar: The Last Airbender", "first_air_date": "2005-02-21", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 255, "name": "Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi", "adult": false, "overview": "Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi follows the adventures of two very cool, but very different pop stars as they travel from gig to gig or just hang out in their tour bus. Being famous rock stars, Ami and Yumi tour the globe in their customized Puffy bus, a veritable condo on wheels with all the major amenities and an ever-changing interior. Ami is the peppy, positive, and resourceful one. Yumi is the hard-rocking, no-nonsense cynic with an absolutely infallible sense of cool. Together, these superstars take the world by storm with musical talent, trend-setting style and humor, despite occasional misjudgments from their well-meaning but tragically square manager, Kaz.", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10762], "popularity": 7.3793, "vote_count": 139, "poster_path": "/dVlsQzfxewEdHpu7SiVUpRAVNyU.jpg", "vote_average": 7.295, "backdrop_path": "/16JZ5IRrA9YSxVSqWflY0nLhLwz.jpg", "original_name": "Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi", "first_air_date": "2004-11-19", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 318, "name": "American Gothic", "adult": false, "overview": "Everything is not what it seems in Trinity, South Carolina. Sheriff Lucas Buck develops a sinister interest in Caleb. Caleb's cousin Gail tries to protect him, but that's complicated since she has feelings for Sheriff Buck. And Caleb's dead sister, Merlyn, returns as an angel, warning him that Buck is an incarnation of evil - and may not be human.", "genre_ids": [10765, 18, 80], "popularity": 2.7776, "vote_count": 55, "poster_path": "/qajOMTtQ958JEpmokPXTruwA9qp.jpg", "vote_average": 7.327, "backdrop_path": "/itisXkOIsntQacvuO5BF05xHJ60.jpg", "original_name": "American Gothic", "first_air_date": "1995-09-22", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 250396, "name": "Thousandaires", "adult": false, "overview": "Comedians are given a thousand dollars to spend on their friends and their wildest dreams.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 1.2525, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/7vo1o3ri4cPn0xVq78qniRbGAyK.jpg", "vote_average": 6.5, "backdrop_path": "/xlIxQ6W8f2N0iS7WV9vADt0xRsV.jpg", "original_name": "Thousandaires", "first_air_date": "2024-05-31", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 98874, "name": "The Great Ruler", "adult": false, "overview": "A young boy with insurmountable potential starts on an adventure to become a great hero who fights on the side of good. Along the way, he forms lasting friendships and finds love.\\n\\nMu Chen was born in the Mu region. His father is the Mu Chief, but a series of tragic events forced his mother to abandon Mu Chen early in his life. Mu Chen swore to become strong, seek out his mother, and reunite with her. Mu Chen’s natural talents give him the chance to cultivate his skills for competition. During his training, he saves a young girl, Luo Li, and the two quickly fall in love. In order to find his birth mother, Mu Chen leaves his hometown and enters the earthly world to face dark forces and save his loved ones.", "genre_ids": [10759, 18, 10765], "popularity": 2.1535, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/uf63KMNo78hR7GcWybrQZnzowXt.jpg", "vote_average": 8, "backdrop_path": "/6sLYJGx6BD5Rrs3M9DMjkeDZrfq.jpg", "original_name": "北灵少年志之大主宰", "first_air_date": "2020-01-30", "origin_country": ["CN"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 226670, "name": "Cherry Magic", "adult": false, "overview": "Achi, a shy office worker, gains mind-reading powers at 30. He discovers his charming colleague Karan's feelings for him, sparking a whirlwind of emotions.", "genre_ids": [18, 10765], "popularity": 2.4189, "vote_count": 16, "poster_path": "/q3PaIEPemFf3w4jGohaohFtnogm.jpg", "vote_average": 9.1, "backdrop_path": "/1e3FcJ7iesPUlulkmoZOWN4olYg.jpg", "original_name": "30 ยังซิง", "first_air_date": "2023-12-09", "origin_country": ["TH"], "original_language": "th"}, {"id": 250748, "name": "Safe House", "adult": false, "overview": "Safe House follows the lives of eight GMMTV artists morning to night as they live under one roof and compete to win a grand prize.", "genre_ids": [35, 10764], "popularity": 2.4619, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/lM0EceSa5xayrac1bOefgYJcdpj.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": "/kp4MjXgQbzOwX35OVKciSkh9xlx.jpg", "original_name": "SAFE HOUSE บ้านลับ