pg", "vote_average": 7.158, "backdrop_path": "/qiDOjpLj2KGDwM5MGx9YZpOrBRX.jpg", "original_name": "Under the Dome", "first_air_date": "2013-06-24", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46367, "name": "Small Island", "adult": false, "overview": "Follow three intricately connected stories of Jamaicans and Londoners involved in World War Two. Hortense yearns for a new life away from rural Jamaica, Gilbert dreams of becoming a lawyer, and Queenie longs to escape her Lincolnshire roots. Hope and humanity meet stubborn reality as we trace the tangled history of Jamaica and the UK.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.5938, "vote_count": 13, "poster_path": "/lq6fBrjJt30N6ZUDuzBif9B8IwG.jpg", "vote_average": 5.9, "backdrop_path": "/u5dFY7dzwaxD2Ga42LGv6CAvYMh.jpg", "original_name": "Small Island", "first_air_date": "2009-12-06", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46374, "name": "Katanagatari", "adult": false, "overview": "The legendary swordsmith Kiki Shikizaki created 1,000 swords in his career. The more of the swords a country owns, the higher its chances are at winning a war. When the shogun emerged victorious, he collected 988 swords, but these were merely the “practice pieces”. The last twelve swords were the crowning achievements of Kiki’s career. Each one of them is so powerful that a single man could defeat an army with it.\\n\\nTogame, the shogun’s strategist, gets the order to collect these swords. At first she hired a ninja, but each of the swords’ value is so high that the entire ninja clan went rogue once they got hold of one. She then put her trust in another warrior, but he kept the sword for himself. Her final hope now is Shichika, the seventh and last student of the Kyotoryuu School.", "genre_ids": [10759, 16, 18], "popularity": 2.7127, "vote_count": 54, "poster_path": "/ii4D1K3XJvOLQuaYcP0Oh3mL6JC.jpg", "vote_average": 7.38, "backdrop_path": "/aMqe9Ne9Rx3HZa3sdquqWnTmAQL.jpg", "original_name": "刀語", "first_air_date": "2010-01-25", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72157, "name": "The Family Game", "adult": false, "overview": "Yoshimoto Koya becomes a tutor to a student, Numata Shigeyuki, an underachiever on the verge of dropping out of middle school. Expecting immediate results, Shigeyuki’s father makes a deal with Koya that if he could make Shigeyuki return to school within a week, he would receive a 100,000 yen bonus. Koya accepts the offer, replying that he would only need 5 days to complete the mission but demands that no one should interfere with his methodology in doing so.", "genre_ids": [18, 10751, 9648], "popularity": 1.1071, "vote_count": 10, "poster_path": "/mvoA0ux8m3FmAf1st2An7E96heb.jpg", "vote_average": 7, "backdrop_path": "/mA5ePucv0mLlaBbzwp0UaxsZgA2.jpg", "original_name": "家族ゲーム", "first_air_date": "2013-04-17", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72167, "name": "Never Let Me Go", "adult": false, "overview": "30-year-old Kyoko has a \\"job\\". The story starts with her looking back 20 years to her boarding school of Yoko Gakuen in the mountains. Tomohiko, Miwa, and Kyoko are all in the same grade. Inspired by the educational philosophy of the principal - Emiko, teacher Tatsuko joins the boarding school staff, but soon finds the school rather strange...", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.0008, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/sGpqhD9kKiP3abxOrzYWRy05lV2.jpg", "vote_average": 7, "backdrop_path": "/lhLQWWtBtFhyOH2Iv9zSs9ohjiX.jpg", "original_name": "わたしを離さないで", "first_air_date": "2016-01-15", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 98492, "name": "The Ghost Bride", "adult": false, "overview": "In 1890s Malacca, Li Lan finds herself in the afterlife and becomes mired in a mystery linked to the sinister, deceased son of a wealthy family.", "genre_ids": [9648, 18, 10751], "popularity": 1.4526, "vote_count": 20, "poster_path": "/if27EYCdFPSh45WbUqPLo47wb1o.jpg", "vote_average": 6.6, "backdrop_path": "/jxA3BMwqSJ9zDQpO25W6xveIJaT.jpg", "original_name": "彼岸之嫁", "first_air_date": "2020-01-23", "origin_country": ["TW", "MY"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 98522, "name": "Inés of My Soul", "adult": false, "overview": "Inés Suárez, a young, humble woman from Extremadura who sets out for the New World to look for her husband, lost on the other side of the Atlantic along with his dreams of glory. Once there, Inés does not find her husband, but she does find the passionate love of Pedro de Valdivia, Francisco Pizarro's Field Master.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.5239, "vote_count": 24, "poster_path": "/q3lUWZSxNo7TWNxHwqHs0PQTkGA.jpg", "vote_average": 6.6, "backdrop_path": "/AS5jwH6GUr5kAERstYcJU9gXqz.jpg", "original_name": "Inés del alma mía", "first_air_date": "2020-07-31", "origin_country": ["ES"], "original_language": "es"}, {"id": 289, "name": "Fearless", "adult": false, "overview": "Born with a genetic defect, 23-year-old agent Gaia lacks one of the most basic human instincts: fear. She works for an elite Special Investigations Unit (SIU) staffed with the finest young agents to infiltrate and apprehend society's dangerous new class of young criminals. While her partners Ryan and Harmony suspect she has a secret, they have no choice but to trust her. Whether her rare mutation is an important asset or a deadly liability for the unit remains to be seen.", "genre_ids": [80, 18], "popularity": 1.5288, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/b0HkkISlAxYZceH5RVAUCBcsryg.jpg", "vote_average": 7, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "Fearless", "first_air_date": "", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 250308, "name": "Earth Abides", "adult": false, "overview": "When a plague of unprecedented virulence sweeps the globe, the human race is all but wiped out. In the aftermath, as the great machine of civilization slowly and inexorably breaks down, only a few shattered survivors remain to struggle against the slide into extinction.", "genre_ids": [10765], "popularity": 5.9779, "vote_count": 117, "poster_path": "/c8huM0hQ5fCjGFDyUmpQW9x0xmR.jpg", "vote_average": 7.338, "backdrop_path": "/g97e0jUEjvVBF5Ald9oD7eWNMN4.jpg", "original_name": "Earth Abides", "first_air_date": "2024-12-01", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 250312, "name": "Caught", "adult": false, "overview": "Known for catching criminals, famed reporter Ema Garay faces a dilemma when the suspect in a teen's disappearance turns out to be someone close to her.", "genre_ids": [18, 80], "popularity": 2.1535, "vote_count": 53, "poster_path": "/nqDuaec5toH2DTWpcUxhfgMJUbs.jpg", "vote_average": 7.16, "backdrop_path": "/4FXRxkYqL2bxHPQdL9zzRV4D4Po.jpg", "original_name": "Atrapados", "first_air_date": "2025-03-26", "origin_country": ["AR"], "original_language": "es"}, {"id": 250446, "name": "The Name of the Game Is a Kidnapping", "adult": false, "overview": "Shunsuke Sakuma works with numerous clients as a planner for an advertising agency. He is somewhat of a mysterious man and popular with women. He deals with his work and his personal life in the same manner, like he is playing a game. He is currently working on a large project involving a car company. The project is progressing well, but he is suddenly excluded from the project by the car company's vice president, Katsutoshi Katsuragi. Shunsuke Sakuma’s pride is wounded from his exclusion and he becomes extremely upset at that. He happens to meet Juri Katsuragi who is Katsutoshi Katsuragi’s daughter. She also holds a grudge against her father. Shunsuke Sakuma and Juri Katsuragi decides to team up to get revenge. They take part in a kidnapping game.", "genre_ids": [9648, 18], "popularity": 2.4811, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/z5CRjPPMGlxcKhUkY0w9Qx0JLfA.jpg", "vote_average": 6, "backdrop_path": "/ezEnzklrBiXfU44zEVoFJrQoLF7.jpg", "original_name": "ゲームの名は誘拐", "first_air_date": "2024-06-09", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 226270, "name": "Love in Pavilion", "adult": false, "overview": "It tells the story of Dongfang Huaizhu and Wangquan Hongye, the leaders of two major families, the Dongfangs and the Wangquans. In a time when humans and demons are in conflict, they work together to stabilize the situation in order to revive the Unity Alliance. On the seventh day of the seventh month, at the Bamboo Pavilion by the Huai River, their fates intertwine like the sheaths of two swords, never to be separated. They pick up the most heartwarming promise and tell a story that has endured for generations.", "genre_ids": [18, 10765, 10759], "popularity": 6.0804, "vote_count": 8, "poster_path": "/rz9njPrgpOWKlXeU3e3lvMChjnD.jpg", "vote_average": 8.6, "backdrop_path": "/v5gASVk9yLsKd3h6c44yPIy8PKr.jpg", "original_name": "淮水竹亭", "first_air_date": "2025-04-28", "origin_country": ["CN"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 226300, "name": "I Have a Smart Doctor Wife", "adult": false, "overview": "After a freak accident, modern doctor Yun Ruoyue is transported to ancient times, where she uses her medical skills to save lives. Forced to marry Crown Prince Li, the two start as opposites but gradually grow closer as they work together to protect and heal the people.", "genre_ids": [35, 18], "popularity": 2.152, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/kNMHt91iEFgvFuRlNnUlWrksu45.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": "/e6F0y7AHHpbNGZTboL8RF9GF2ks.jpg", "original_name": "我的医妃不好惹", "first_air_date": "2023-04-30", "origin_country": ["CN"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 250833, "name": "Blue Canvas of Youthful Days", "adult": false, "overview": "Trapped by legacy and pride, a privileged art student clashes with a struggling painter—unaware he's the online muse he's secretly longed for.", "genre_ids": [18, 10751], "popularity": 1.927, "vote_count": 17, "poster_path": "/9pp6OiXADyTkzzZAJ67zuGnPMAp.jpg", "vote_average": 8.3, "backdrop_path": "/jDnYvw3TSk0ojkU4p0j5kBVFqeU.jpg", "original_name": "路过我年少时光的蓝色", "first_air_date": "2024-10-26", "origin_country": ["CN"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 250957, "name": "My Marvellous Dream Is You", "adult": false, "overview": "I'm Dawan. Since I can remember, I have always had strange dreams about a quiet girl who often played with me in my dreams. One day, a new neighbor moved in, and that led to my family falling apart. My father ran away with the man next door, who turned out to be the father of Khimhan the quiet and small girl from next door. Initially, we were not close at all, but circumstances brought us closer and made us understand each other.\\n\\nHowever, Khimhan was unaware that while in the real world we were just friends, in my dreams, she and I did things that went far beyond that. So, I kept my feelings concealed because I couldn't let her know. I never realized that in those dreams, I was not the only one dreaming.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 2.166, "vote_count": 8, "poster_path": "/nMEBQAmcHdBudqiRYGblgivMdmP.jpg", "vote_average": 7.375, "backdrop_path": "/8LdHg0aMrmROcU8LlSRRx1FiphC.jpg", "original_name": "ฝันรักห้วงนิทรา", "first_air_date": "2024-05-08", "origin_country": ["TH"], "original_language": "th"}, {"id": 787, "name": "Wycliffe", "adult": false, "overview": "Wycliffe is a British television series, based on W. J. Burley's novels about Detective Superintendent Charles Wycliffe. It was produced by HTV and broadcast on the ITV Network, following a pilot episode on 7 August 1993, between 24 July 1994 and 5 July 1998. The series was filmed in Cornwall, with a production office in Truro. Music for the series was composed by Nigel Hess and was awarded the Royal Television Society award for the best television theme. Wycliffe is played by Jack Shepherd, assisted by DI Doug Kersey and DI Lucy Lane.\\n\\nEach episode deals with a murder investigation. In the early series, the stories are adapted from Burley's books and are in classic whodunit style, often with quirky characters and plot elements. In later seasons, the tone becomes more naturalistic and there is more emphasis on internal politics within the police.", "genre_ids": [80, 18], "popularity": 8.0771, "vote_count": 3, "poster_path": "/c1oq4XHTCPF3hwV4F4ZzkQCMpXS.jpg", "vote_average": 6, "backdrop_path": "/8RxSSQeXHZQ8samfjmV0hTAbDch.jpg", "original_name": "Wycliffe", "first_air_date": "1994-07-24", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 790, "name": "Agatha Christie's Poirot", "adult": false, "overview": "From England to Egypt, accompanied by his elegant and trustworthy sidekicks, the intelligent yet eccentrically-refined Belgian detective Hercule Poirot pits his wits against a collection of first class deceptions.", "genre_ids": [80, 18, 9648], "popularity": 35.5156, "vote_count": 517, "poster_path": "/6f4IVfbn8knb7RjdZlGLuW5guDc.jpg", "vote_average": 8.17, "backdrop_path": "/rwxxDbG9Kijki7CkmB4k64MSbte.jpg", "original_name": "Agatha Christie's Poirot", "first_air_date": "1989-01-08", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 72642, "name": "Invasion", "adult": false, "overview": "Small rocks fall from the sky which, when touched, trigger a latent virus that has always existed in humans and begins mutating them into an alien species. Taking advantage of its hive mentality, the aliens are absolutely dedicated to transforming every human on Earth and do so with alarming swiftness. Only a small group of humans remain who have the medical knowledge to devise antibodies to reverse the effects of the virus.", "genre_ids": [10765], "popularity": 1.7002, "vote_count": 20, "poster_path": "/dyoohpYI6jremCvfAXehByacppu.jpg", "vote_average": 5.6, "backdrop_path": "/sEpQ1OdbAIKe4PIyUtcBdzsTCZH.jpg", "original_name": "Invasion", "first_air_date": "1997-05-04", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 72644, "name": "Jules Verne's Mysterious Island", "adult": false, "overview": "During the Civil War five survivors escape from a prison camp in Richmond, Virginia by hot air balloon and find themselves on an uncharted island in the Pacific. Far from any kind of known civilization, the island is inhabited with carnivorous monsters, bloodthirsty pirates, and mad genius Captain Nemo, who lives on the island for his own secretive ends.", "genre_ids": [10759, 10765], "popularity": 2.1609, "vote_count": 40, "poster_path": "/ea0BBhtuAVtOosZwVdgOrtj8oRD.jpg", "vote_average": 5.2, "backdrop_path": "/3jaCsqIK7o6YLUN1EI6X56firPf.jpg", "original_name": "Jules Verne's Mysterious Island", "first_air_date": "2005-09-17", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}], "total_pages": 2715, "total_results": 54298}	2025-10-17 09:15:11.21	2025-10-17 09:15:11.21
