QS6eg4Qw4brepEtYDZ.jpg", "original_name": "Ackley Bridge", "first_air_date": "2017-06-07", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 72125, "name": "Date My Dad", "adult": false, "overview": "Since the loss of his beloved Isabella three years ago, Ricky Cooper's only agenda has been to be the best dad he can be. But little does Ricky realize that his girls have an agenda of their own: get dad a girlfriend.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.3963, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/r02SV1QgRGfRsEWQZgWYSc28SW6.jpg", "vote_average": 6.5, "backdrop_path": "/aTzd5Bin2EIfZr3auY8pfp8Ak5F.jpg", "original_name": "Date My Dad", "first_air_date": "2017-06-02", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 186, "name": "Weeds", "adult": false, "overview": "After the unexpected death of her husband, a suburban mom resorts to selling weed to support her family.", "genre_ids": [35, 80, 18], "popularity": 16.8313, "vote_count": 923, "poster_path": "/gKUsBTa5b0GY7U4iWBseeBalfjO.jpg", "vote_average": 7.492, "backdrop_path": "/6k6vAUa0Fm73HB0QBOJbFGTgPq5.jpg", "original_name": "Weeds", "first_air_date": "2005-08-07", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 204, "name": "Freddie", "adult": false, "overview": "Freddie Moreno had finally escaped from the raucous house of women with whom he grew up. Having achieved some success as head chef at a trendy Chicago restaurant, he's ready for love and everything else that single life has to offer, including hanging out with his best friend and neighbor, Chris. Unfortunately, there's one slight hitch: After the death of his older brother and the collapse of his sister's marriage, goodhearted Freddie took in his impulsive sister-in-law, his pragmatic sister with her 13-year-old daughter and their irascible grandma, who refuses to speak English and only responds in Spanish – even though she understands every word. But while the members of this unconventional brood may test Freddie's patience endlessly, they also support and take care of one another, just as they always have. Now all Freddie has to do is figure out how to maintain his thriving bachelor lifestyle in a house overflowing with estrogen.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 2.689, "vote_count": 8, "poster_path": "/u9bQCwHHQ58TCK24voky5ZUMZAf.jpg", "vote_average": 4.9, "backdrop_path": "/4pkfYSKP3oQ4B7EXnmCKODgwqNM.jpg", "original_name": "Freddie", "first_air_date": "2005-10-12", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 269, "name": "One Tree Hill", "adult": false, "overview": "In Tree Hill, North Carolina two half brothers share a last name and nothing else. Brooding, blue-collar Lucas is a talented street-side basketball player, but his skills are appreciated only by his friends at the river court. Popular, affluent Nathan basks in the hero-worship of the town, as the star of his high school team. And both boys are the son of former college ball player Dan Scott whose long ago choice to abandon Lucas and his mother Karen, will haunt him long into his life with wife Deb and their son Nathan.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 25.6761, "vote_count": 538, "poster_path": "/sOrelBaAhp7DZbPTivDwKEyPslC.jpg", "vote_average": 7.787, "backdrop_path": "/eDNSgT1xPMKYcEzJ5GG0PCE3NcN.jpg", "original_name": "One Tree Hill", "first_air_date": "2003-09-23", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 316, "name": "Maniac Mansion", "adult": false, "overview": "Maniac Mansion was a Canadian sitcom created by Eugene Levy, which aired concurrently on YTV in Canada and The Family Channel in the United States for three seasons from September 17, 1990 to April 4, 1993.\\n\\nThe series is very loosely based on the popular 1987 LucasArts video game of the same name. While LucasFilm served as co-producers on the series, the show thematically shares little in common with its source material.\\n\\nThe series followed the adventures of the Edison family, who lived in a large mansion in an upper-class suburban neighborhood. Fred, the father of the family, was an eccentric scientist, and many of the plots revolved around his wacky experiments. One of these experiments caused his toddler son, Turner, to transform into a large adult man and his brother-in-law, Harry, to be turned into a fly with a human head! They both remained this way for the entire run of the series.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 2.4765, "vote_count": 7, "poster_path": "/8GMqddbgAVH129mkuevOaZLPLCI.jpg", "vote_average": 4.7, "backdrop_path": "/bOkk45VacJdxTUepRsgntKbcotE.jpg", "original_name": "Maniac Mansion", "first_air_date": "1990-09-17", "origin_country": ["CA", "US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 695, "name": "Round the Twist", "adult": false, "overview": "Round the Twist is a Logie Award-winning Australian children's television series about three children and their father who live in a lighthouse and become involved in many bizarre magical adventures.", "genre_ids": [35, 10762, 10765, 99], "popularity": 3.0526, "vote_count": 25, "poster_path": "/nxOScaEU2exYLBkqG8LiYL69z5l.jpg", "vote_average": 7, "backdrop_path": "/qYitUEDAV8et1Y60XIYgel5rP3M.jpg", "original_name": "Round the Twist", "first_air_date": "1990-04-06", "origin_country": ["AU", "DE", "FR"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 72735, "name": "The Detail", "adult": false, "overview": "Three fiercely talented female homicide investigators work tirelessly to solve crimes while navigating the complicated demands of their personal lives.", "genre_ids": [80, 18], "popularity": 1.8222, "vote_count": 17, "poster_path": "/9Ec8QfalJdDDWoAGTTjMH1V3PTD.jpg", "vote_average": 6.4, "backdrop_path": "/uuZwhJYs2zTVcmLfsSRGR9qyy1Q.jpg", "original_name": "The Detail", "first_air_date": "2018-03-25", "origin_country": ["CA"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46975, "name": "Crossing Lines", "adult": false, "overview": "Through globalization, many countries have been opened and barriers removed to ensure easy trade, travel and cultural diversity. However, this openness has given opportunities to criminals looking to exploit the system and ultimately threaten our global safety. As Europe has become a \\"safe house\\" for criminals eluding law enforcers, a special kind of law enforcement team is needed to handle specific ongoing crimes on a global level. \\"Crossing Lines\\" is the story of one such team, made up of five international cops, headed by Captain Daniel. The team - comprised of individuals who have little in common - must learn to live and work under the most dangerous and potentially deadly conditions. Housed in an unused storage section underneath the ICC, this mismatched team faces bureaucratic, jurisdictional and cultural obstacles while traversing continents in pursuit of justice.", "genre_ids": [10759, 80, 18], "popularity": 6.4917, "vote_count": 115, "poster_path": "/ow8RQrZJUQfOeR5alsj9OAXoxic.jpg", "vote_average": 6.648, "backdrop_path": "/46CHPlDDTRNyMuSMQ64FS4nUrtM.jpg", "original_name": "Crossing Lines", "first_air_date": "2013-08-22", "origin_country": ["DE", "BE", "FR", "US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 99047, "name": "Record of Youth", "adult": false, "overview": "In a cutthroat world where the life you’re born into decides your success, three aspiring youths are determined to change that perception as they fight for their dreams.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 4.0883, "vote_count": 230, "poster_path": "/54yTLS5d4OPOuunzOvHlmP82eIT.jpg", "vote_average": 8.061, "backdrop_path": "/18ypvPahjmmue1iR4N4YgTBrO8N.jpg", "original_name": "청춘기록", "first_air_date": "2020-09-07", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 201043, "name": "Night's Stars", "adult": false, "overview": "", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 0.6772, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/erpJUvXGpFrhpOC7peAwDmFUqWM.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "نجوم الليل", "first_air_date": "2009-08-21", "origin_country": ["TN"], "original_language": "ar"}, {"id": 47091, "name": "That Winter, the Wind Blows", "adult": false, "overview": "Circumstances condemn Oh Soo and Oh Young to loveless lives. After the untimely death of his first love, Oh Soo turns to an ambitionless life as a derelict gambler. The gorgeous Oh Young should be leading the perfect life as an heiress, but when her parents’ divorce crumbles the family, she faces the reality of living life alone—particularly in light of her increasingly impaired vision. When these two heavy souls cross paths, fate delivers a chance meeting that will change their lives forever.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 2.9947, "vote_count": 35, "poster_path": "/ibBjm3Bh4hw0uo4sTyK6cwzCRjg.jpg", "vote_average": 7.2, "backdrop_path": "/af37ZYhNIUy7FRWsjrmPhITfPtd.jpg", "original_name": "그 겨울, 바람이 분다", "first_air_date": "2013-02-13", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 23621, "name": "Police Story", "adult": false, "overview": "Police Story is an anthology series, that aired in late 1988 as part of the 'ABC Monday Mystery Movie' line-up. The crime drama is a revival of the original Police Story series (1973–1979), using previous scripts for all five two-hour episode remakes.", "genre_ids": [18, 80], "popularity": 0.4221, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": null, "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "Police Story", "first_air_date": "1988-10-29", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 23656, "name": "Sherman Oaks", "adult": false, "overview": "Sherman Oaks is an adult comedy that premiered on Showtime in the summer of 1995. A second season ran in the summer of 1996. The show focused on the Sanford Baker Family of earthquake ravaged Sherman Oaks, California.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 1.5226, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/tHJbAEHO0qz5prINfLy9NrwOLjm.jpg", "vote_average": 5, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "Sherman Oaks", "first_air_date": "1995-07-16", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_