hilling stories from India's heartland. This is the VICE guide to crime.", "genre_ids": [99, 80], "popularity": 0.6267, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/h0QxS2QXRDZmX6Xb1pHOc4ijESa.jpg", "vote_average": 9, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "K se Crime", "first_air_date": "2018-12-07", "origin_country": [], "original_language": "hi"}, {"id": 383, "name": "Cain's Hundred", "adult": false, "overview": "A former underworld lawyer goes to work for the Federal Government, determined to bring 100 top criminals to justice.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 3.2111, "vote_count": 3, "poster_path": "/gF52PA0wga7Cl5VWcjZ3wVVYTg.jpg", "vote_average": 4.7, "backdrop_path": "/3IPbuOFNBv3A4ygYHTItlxVgeMl.jpg", "original_name": "Cain's Hundred", "first_air_date": "1961-09-19", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 625, "name": "The Black Donnellys", "adult": false, "overview": "Meet the Donnelly brothers: Tommy, Jimmy, Kevin and Sean. There is nothing these four Irish brothers wouldn't do to protect each other, and for them that means lying, cheating, stealing and, occasionally, calling the cops. Narrated by wannabe gangster Joey \\"Ice Cream,\\" this gritty series bears witness to the Donnelly brothers' sudden involvement in organized crime, focusing on how they go from boys to mobsters, and showing how their new life affects their relationships with friends, family and lovers.", "genre_ids": [18, 80], "popularity": 2.6863, "vote_count": 70, "poster_path": "/hRKjeP8laTHS9q5cJA046DJa5kA.jpg", "vote_average": 7.7, "backdrop_path": "/7MNHo538VQQUqRWthYP1XWZovnL.jpg", "original_name": "The Black Donnellys", "first_air_date": "2007-02-26", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 124727, "name": "Sinister Beings", "adult": false, "overview": "Hui Chun-sum is an elite OCTB officer. He is fearless and competent. His boss thinks highly of him, and his colleagues really admire him. But his ultimate dream is to join SDU. Another elite OCTB officer Shum Wai-lik has a shrewd mind and extensive experience. Although the duo have different approaches, but they are like-minded and ideally complement each other. Police suffer heavy casualties as they are ambushed by thugs. To catch the culprit, Chun-sum forgets his dream and stays with OCTB. Moreover, Chun-sum and Wai-lik are faced with successive nasty cases that are tortuous, surreptitious, tricky and baffling. The duo use reverse thinking, psychological game theory and meticulous analysis to decipher the criminals’ thoughts and motives. No crook can escape the long arm of the law!", "genre_ids": [80, 10759, 18], "popularity": 4.3168, "vote_count": 3, "poster_path": "/o8ygqy0d7xrW1Qhpc3Fdaio7Y2d.jpg", "vote_average": 8.3, "backdrop_path": "/3Xtc2iqCBXoXFmD8GhVdYaIY111.jpg", "original_name": "逆天奇案", "first_air_date": "2021-05-03", "origin_country": ["HK"], "original_language": "cn"}, {"id": 22801, "name": "The Gangster Chronicles", "adult": false, "overview": "", "genre_ids": [80, 18], "popularity": 1.562, "vote_count": 5, "poster_path": "/bt4dH0rfrTqNjxPVhAPMCuCQggY.jpg", "vote_average": 6.8, "backdrop_path": "/pts0egBuP9LO0iCpBXXRqj2xQQD.jpg", "original_name": "The Gangster Chronicles", "first_air_date": "1981-02-12", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 1396, "name": "Breaking Bad", "adult": false, "overview": "Walter White, a New Mexico chemistry teacher, is diagnosed with Stage III cancer and given a prognosis of only two years left to live. He becomes filled with a sense of fearlessness and an unrelenting desire to secure his family's financial future at any cost as he enters the dangerous world of drugs and crime.", "genre_ids": [18, 80], "popularity": 91.1616, "vote_count": 16238, "poster_path": "/ztkUQFLlC19CCMYHW9o1zWhJRNq.jpg", "vote_average": 8.9, "backdrop_path": "/tsRy63Mu5cu8etL1X7ZLyf7UP1M.jpg", "original_name": "Breaking Bad", "first_air_date": "2008-01-20", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 1398, "name": "The Sopranos", "adult": false, "overview": "The story of New Jersey-based Italian-American mobster Tony Soprano and the difficulties he faces as he tries to balance the conflicting requirements of his home life and the criminal organization he heads. Those difficulties are often highlighted through his ongoing professional relationship with psychiatrist Jennifer Melfi. The show features Tony's family members and Mafia associates in prominent roles and story arcs, most notably his wife Carmela and his cousin and protégé Christopher Moltisanti.", "genre_ids": [80, 18], "popularity": 42.7927, "vote_count": 3138, "poster_path": "/rTc7ZXdroqjkKivFPvCPX0Ru7uw.jpg", "vote_average": 8.7, "backdrop_path": "/lNpkvX2s8LGB0mjGODMT4o6Up7j.jpg", "original_name": "The Sopranos", "first_air_date": "1999-01-10", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 1406, "name": "Deadwood", "adult": false, "overview": "The story of the early days of Deadwood, South Dakota; woven around actual historic events with most of the main characters based on real people. Deadwood starts as a gold mining camp and gradually turns from a lawless wild-west community into an organized wild-west civilized town. The story focuses on the real-life characters Seth Bullock and Al Swearengen.", "genre_ids": [37, 80, 18], "popularity": 12.8157, "vote_count": 874, "poster_path": "/fWwxYAuqY4Na7fKI3Qq2nFWCwG8.jpg", "vote_average": 8.13, "backdrop_path": "/dGzPJnh8YcUS4J10sNunohaXMVn.jpg", "original_name": "Deadwood", "first_air_date": "2004-03-21", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 1423, "name": "Ray Donovan", "adult": false, "overview": "Set in the sprawling mecca of the rich and famous, Ray Donovan does the dirty work for LA's top power players, and makes their problems disappear. His father's unexpected release from prison sets off a chain of events that shakes the Donovan family to its core.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 16.5455, "vote_count": 793