heir code of honor, to the harrowing and detailed descriptions of their work, accompanied by equally graphic images and film footage.", "genre_ids": [99, 80], "popularity": 0.5075, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": "/mrSSUBYtHIhWcTcU00H9XfL2bcr.jpg", "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": "/4FUDKWKAZ5ikW63jchrhdqGxHkB.jpg", "original_name": "Crime Inc.", "first_air_date": "1984-07-18", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 47833, "name": "The Fear", "adult": false, "overview": "Former gang boss turned respected businessman, Richie Beckett pledge money to help rebuild a pier. But Richie's mind is deteriorating, and the other outfit he runs with his sons is under attack by a vicious rival gang.", "genre_ids": [80, 18], "popularity": 1.3085, "vote_count": 15, "poster_path": "/usVYbEtg3Qkci5Jui3c4e1nuT1f.jpg", "vote_average": 6.8, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "The Fear", "first_air_date": "2012-12-03", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 73467, "name": "Godless", "adult": false, "overview": "A ruthless outlaw terrorizes the West in search of a former member of his gang, who’s found a new life in a quiet town populated only by women.", "genre_ids": [37, 18], "popularity": 4.8059, "vote_count": 644, "poster_path": "/1RUY14vkF9Qqu2sA2amiP7LP9t7.jpg", "vote_average": 7.761, "backdrop_path": "/3CdnJBsEm2hZffF23wOJtfC0EIq.jpg", "original_name": "Godless", "first_air_date": "2017-11-22", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 73527, "name": "Kapitán Exner", "adult": false, "overview": "", "genre_ids": [18, 80], "popularity": 0.6803, "vote_count": 1, "poster_path": "/8qig7aLlpLC6nsI2c7BrOo1k3QM.jpg", "vote_average": 8, "backdrop_path": "/xrlLo3Tsb0ZWqeoU9iA7c5FlN4d.jpg", "original_name": "Kapitán Exner", "first_air_date": "2017-08-26", "origin_country": ["CZ"], "original_language": "cs"}], "total_pages": 2491, "total_results": 49816}	2025-10-17 10:28:35.851	2025-10-17 10:28:35.851
