ンダム0080 ポケットの中の戦争", "first_air_date": "1989-03-25", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 46523, "name": "Jejoongwon", "adult": false, "overview": "Jejoongwon is the first modern hospital in Korea established in the Joseon era in 1885. Baek Do Yang is a nobleman who gives up his status to enter its ranks. Hwang Jung is a butcher's son who becomes a physician, while Seok Ran enters Jejoongwon as an interpreter but takes on medical training to become a doctor.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.5425, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/xhSNQaDvvIHLXPY5LIqnw6HWawh.jpg", "vote_average": 8.2, "backdrop_path": "/vAJL2TUql8N1pgoz8SGt4JblaHi.jpg", "original_name": "제중원", "first_air_date": "2010-01-04", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46539, "name": "Miss Rose", "adult": false, "overview": "Luo Si Yi seeks out the obligatory services of Lily, a local fortune teller, but when she receives her fortune she’s unwilling to accept the mystical decree that she’s doomed to be a spinster for life. Si Yi wagers that she’ll get married within a year, and if she wins, Lily must pole dance at her wedding. But should Si Yi fail, she’ll truly make a fortune teller out of Lily: Si Yi will pay her one million dollars. Gussied up for the dating circuit, Si Yi soon finds she’s got a challenge in balancing romance with the demands of her boss Gao Cheng Kuan. Is Cheng Kuang just another cosmic obstacle for Si Yi to overcome, or a blessing in disguise?", "genre_ids": [18, 35], "popularity": 2.3658, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/zLHy5pRCqxYZ6ciyPE48CCSwxaF.jpg", "vote_average": 3, "backdrop_path": "/Anv2FSM1TfEKAL38YC0N0vaBC2X.jpg", "original_name": "螺丝小姐要出嫁", "first_air_date": "2012-07-22", "origin_country": ["TW"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 46540, "name": "Full House Take 2", "adult": false, "overview": "Full House Take 2 is a 2012 South Korean television series that was jointly produced by Korean, Chinese and Japanese companies. It aired on Japan's TBS-cable affiliate TBS Channel 2, and South Korean cable channel SBS Plus.\\n\\nThe term \\"sequel\\" is used loosely, since the series only shares the same premise as Won Soo-yeon's manhwa and the original 2004 hit Full House, but has a completely different set of characters and plot.", "genre_ids": [35, 18], "popularity": 1.5956, "vote_count": 12, "poster_path": "/9FtZeeYwAgwV740nnxGduVBKKet.jpg", "vote_average": 2.4, "backdrop_path": "/zd92S6fCM7z1bZ6SpdFNqa8OH6P.jpg", "original_name": "풀하우스 TAKE 2", "first_air_date": "2012-10-22", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46548, "name": "I Love You", "adult": false, "overview": "Suk Chul Soo and Na Young Hee are a newly wedded couple with an age gap of 14 years. This is a drama that tells the story of a couple who just had a baby because of a one night stand. It will portray the modern generation's view on love and marriage as well as the responsibility of raising a child. Park Byung Ho was thoughtless and threw away his child for a better income and life who later regrets this and learns to love.", "genre_ids": [18, 35], "popularity": 0.6276, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/pb03iYYOhPQYR8gsBAnPc5gDgit.jpg", "vote_average": 5.5, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "사랑해", "first_air_date": "2008-04-07", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46550, "name": "Flower Boy Next Door", "adult": false, "overview": "Go Dok Mi doesn't spend all day dreaming about her knight in shining armor — she’s too busy spying on her neighbors who all happen to be hot, \\"flower-boy\\" types, including cartoon artist Oh Jin Rak. But when Enrique Geum, the new pretty boy next door, catches her, Dok Mi is finally forced to face the consequences - without the safety of binoculars and curtains. Will he be able to convince this “urban Rapunzel” to let her hair down? Whether you’re a lover or a fighter, this sensitive man will captivate your sensibilities.", "genre_ids": [35, 18], "popularity": 1.9191, "vote_count": 122, "poster_path": "/qk6EWrC0vsW8umHikq33sBDFfst.jpg", "vote_average": 8.2, "backdrop_path": "/bSwPHPdQlPjoqZGXLXjkO1Rjkje.jpg", "original_name": "이웃집 꽃미남", "first_air_date": "2013-01-07", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46553, "name": "Reply 1997", "adult": false, "overview": "As a teen, Shi Won was obsessed with a boy band. Now 33 years old, Shi Won and her friends are reviving their memories as their school reunion nears.", "genre_ids": [35, 18], "popularity": 2.5874, "vote_count": 64, "poster_path": "/onW5VNmzZuDYmkSeFhtSibt0rRq.jpg", "vote_average": 7.891, "backdrop_path": "/qph3c3QKAMsljHM7S0tI25MlQkD.jpg", "original_name": "응답하라 1997", "first_air_date": "2012-07-24", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46561, "name": "Spotlight", "adult": false, "overview": "What does it take to succeed in the tough world of broadcast news? Seo Woo Jin  joins the bustling city desk of a major broadcast network, along with the other new reporters, Lee Sun Chul and Yang Myung Eun. Serving as their mentor and trainer is Oh Tae Suk, the veteran journalist who chases down every lead until he gets the story. When Tae Suk sees potential in Woo Jin, he takes a special interest in her career development. As they work closely to exposes the injustices in society, will their relationship deepen into something more?", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.5645, "vote_count": 2, "poster_path": "/tTG3VudZQ6gHcVXxk5c6ksWykKL.jpg", "vote_average": 6, "backdrop_path": "/2KTJzp5C7qIIhhK4oOdW5zYXi9.jpg", "original_name": "스포트라이트", "first_air_date": "2008-05-14", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46568, "name": "Couple Breaking", "adult": false, "overview": "Park Han Byul and Park Kwang Hyun star in this bubbly drama about a committed couple who realize they might not belong together at all. Jeong-seok and Yeo-kyung have been dating for years. Jeong-seok is uncultured and poor, while Yeo-kyung is polished and rich. They both begin to feel dissatisfied, and then they both meet someone else. Can true love overcome habit? Couple Breaking is a light-hearted four-episode mini about romantic switcheroos.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 0.6796, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/as5r4xb6QhJs2hAt2iO3iJzogej.jpg", "vote_average": 1.8, "backdrop_path": "/1bK0VjhrzPRhRQXP8irOuShlveP.jpg", "original_name": "커플브레이킹", "first_air_date": "2007-09-27", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46575, "name": "Beloved", "adult": false, "overview": "The drama tells the love story of a couple who has been married already for 3 years. The couple is still in love but they choose to separate after their past lovers approach them.", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.2287, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/iPmxSJN1L0Y6AclSOl01asmnWoB.jpg", "vote_average": 6.8, "backdrop_path": "/jDhua7Uohas9jFiZ2C9ORPNdzGy.jpg", "original_name": "친애하는 당신에게", "first_air_date": "2012-06-27", "origin_country": ["KR"], "original_language": "ko"}, {"id": 46609, "name": "Upstairs Downstairs", "adult": false, "overview": "Set in 1936, the show takes viewers, old and new, back to the lavish world of Belgravia, London. A new set of occupants reside at 165 Eaton Place and viewers see how external and internal influences of the tumultuous pre-war period shape and mould the lives of this wealthy family and their servants.‬", "genre_ids": [18], "popularity": 1.6811, "vote_count": 43, "poster_path": "/hGh87w2j5huGJeV4VVtnPoR42FZ.jpg", "vote_average": 7.5, "backdrop_path": "/pwUsveFRhYg9XOYMzCCESz40j7X.jpg", "original_name": "Upstairs Downstairs", "first_air_date": "2010-12-26", "origin_country": ["GB"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46619, "name": "Rectify", "adult": false, "overview": "After 19 years on Death Row for the rape and murder of his teenage girlfriend, Daniel Holden is going home. His conviction has been vacated due to new DNA evidence. Now he has to re