ng the injury of a mermaid, or suturing the delicate wounds of a flesh golem, Dr. Glenn performs his job with grace and confidence. But when an unsavory character seeks to steal a harpy egg, how will the unflappable Dr. Glenn respond...?", "genre_ids": [16, 35, 10765], "popularity": 2.8609, "vote_count": 37, "poster_path": "/w0RJVdb1BdEjHAUX1LmzGyUvLaS.jpg", "vote_average": 6.5, "backdrop_path": "/1sWzmUmMPT0cmfgPJkzzZ1VEnqY.jpg", "original_name": "モンスター娘のお医者さん", "first_air_date": "2020-07-12", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72304, "name": "Fate/Apocrypha", "adult": false, "overview": "There was once a Holy Grail War waged by Mages and Heroic Spirits in a town of Fuyuki. However, one Mage took advantage of the chaos of World War II to steal a Holy Grail. Several decades have passed, and the Yggdmillennia family, who took upon the Holy Grail as its symbol, defected from the Mages' Association. Furious, the Association sent forces to deal with the Yggdmillennia, but were defeated. With the Holy Grail system changed, war at an unprecedented scale breaks out.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 18, 10765], "popularity": 3.4551, "vote_count": 161, "poster_path": "/aQvABf8fwwHSdYbMk1Ir3NnvcSp.jpg", "vote_average": 7.385, "backdrop_path": "/nfZLQSZZNS2tRz0yp1xN5RJGpCu.jpg", "original_name": "Fate/Apocrypha", "first_air_date": "2017-07-02", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 72331, "name": "Advance Bravely", "adult": false, "overview": "Sergeant Xia Yao, a reformed playboy, catches the eye of both Yuan Ru and her brother Yuan Zong, sparking a rivalry for his heart.", "genre_ids": [10759, 18], "popularity": 1.7625, "vote_count": 12, "poster_path": "/lDCQpja1QElhNNi5hAENGQrI9X6.jpg", "vote_average": 7.2, "backdrop_path": "/3zGzcHzOTTekPTmhiBG2GNpakoI.jpg", "original_name": "盛势", "first_air_date": "2017-08-08", "origin_country": ["CN"], "original_language": "zh"}, {"id": 72340, "name": "Little Women", "adult": false, "overview": "