ted cartoon series that aired on the CBS network in the fall of 1992.", "genre_ids": [16], "popularity": 2.4162, "vote_count": 4, "poster_path": "/A1IyXZFIiXPMA4y7SvH9FEcSvl.jpg", "vote_average": 8.2, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "Raw Toonage", "first_air_date": "1992-09-19", "origin_country": ["US"], "original_language": "en"}, {"id": 46100, "name": "Celebridade", "adult": false, "overview": "A successful businesswoman in the music industry sees her life fall apart after a young and mysterious woman starts work as her secretary. The scheming girl is totally obsessed by the famous businesswoman and she tries to steal everything from her, including her career.", "genre_ids": [10766, 18, 35], "popularity": 7.9173, "vote_count": 15, "poster_path": "/w1ROW7YvjoPVkQJ6P1yp6rLNOTS.jpg", "vote_average": 8.2, "backdrop_path": "/ciwJBJo9eAs1eZVOdFA4d1S8v4E.jpg", "original_name": "Celebridade", "first_air_date": "2003-10-13", "origin_country": ["BR"], "original_language": "pt"}, {"id": 46260, "name": "Naruto", "adult": false, "overview": "Naruto Uzumaki, a mischievous adolescent ninja, struggles as he searches for recognition and dreams of becoming the Hokage, the village's leader and strongest ninja.", "genre_ids": [16, 10759, 10765], "popularity": 35.0272, "vote_count": 5793, "poster_path": "/xppeysfvDKVx775MFuH8Z9BlpMk.jpg", "vote_average": 8.4, "backdrop_path": "/xuJ0F9RfKvVSJNDg2usurQ9WvY5.jpg", "original_name": "ナルト", "first_air_date": "2002-10-03", "origin_country": ["JP"], "original_language": "ja"}, {"id": 253281, "name": "Tightrope!", "adult": false, "overview": "A reshape of the vintage 1950s series into a slapstick comedy, where Burrell plays a lone wolf detective following cases city to city while he searches for his long-lost love who got away.", "genre_ids": [35], "popularity": 0.9634, "vote_count": 0, "poster_path": null, "vote_average": 0, "backdrop_path": null, "original_name": "Tightrope!", "first_air_date": "", "origin_country": ["US"], "original